{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01S2QtGenBHvfTBDhszKDTqK","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — gen-depth-contamination\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR submission May 25, 2026)\n5\t- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\n6\t- Backup: AAAI 2027 (abstract July 25, paper August 1)\n7\t\n8\t## Canonical Experimental Condition\n9\t\n10\t**Continuation mode 是 cross-model 结论的基础。**\n11\t\n12\t> \"We evaluate both generation modes because real-world recursive contamination can arise from either. Our analysis reveals generation mode as a significant confound, leading us to recommend continuation mode as the canonical condition for cross-model comparisons.\"\n13\t\n14\t| Condition | Pythia↔OLMo | Qwen↔others | 论文定位 |\n15\t|-----------|-------------|-------------|---------|\n16\t| Continuation | 90-92% retention | 80-85% retention | **主实验条件** — cross-model claims 的基础 |\n17\t| Rewrite (instruction) | N/A | 61-63% retention | **upper bound with mode-specific confound** — 仅作 ablation |\n18\t\n19\t**原则**：\n20\t- C1' 的跨模型 claim 必须基于 continuation mode 数据\n21\t- Rewrite mode 的高 AUC (0.6957 vs cont 0.6114) 是 mode-specific signal amplification，不能作为泛化性证据\n22\t- mvp-001 (Qwen-rewrite) 定位为 \"pilot study demonstrating feasibility\"，后续用 continuation mode rigorously validate\n23\t- cont→rw 89% vs rw→cont 82% 不对称性 → continuation features 是 rewrite 的通用子集\n24\t\n25\t## Core Claims (2+1 结构, D012)\n26\t\n27\t### Primary: C1' (K* Characterization)\n28\t首次系统测量递归合成文本的 generational discrimination boundary K*，并揭示其 universality。\n29\t\n30\tDPI 理论证明有限 K*_theory 必然存在（信息论 impossibility boundary）；我们首次在受控实验中测量 K*_empirical，它提供 K*_theory 的保守下界。通过 10 条件实验矩阵（5 model-mode configurations + 4 decoding strategies + 1 cross-scale 7B）系统表征 K*_empirical 的行为，发现 K*=2 在所有 10 个测试条件下保持不变，展现出跨模型架构、跨解码策略、跨生成模式、跨模型规模（1B–7B）、跨 instruct/base 的 universality。\n31\t\n32\t**子组件：**\n33\t\n34\t**(a) K*=2 universality across architectures, generation modes, and decoding strategies**\n35\t> **4/4 model-mode configurations 与 4/4 decoding strategies 全部 K*=2：**\n36\t>\n37\t> *Model × mode (exp-007):*\n38\t> | Model | AUC 1v2 | 95% CI | CI lower > 0.60? |\n39\t> |-------|---------|--------|-----------------|\n40\t> | Qwen-rewrite | 0.6955 | [0.6859, 0.7041] | ✅ (+8.6pp) |\n41\t> | Pythia-1.4B | 0.6539 | [0.6454, 0.6630] | ✅ (+4.5pp) |\n42\t> | OLMo-1B | 0.6145 | [0.6045, 0.6247] | ✅ (+0.45pp) |\n43\t> | Qwen-cont | 0.6112 | [0.6015, 0.6213] | ✅ (+0.15pp, 最边缘) |\n44\t>\n45\t> *Decoding strategy invariance (exp-003):*\n46\t> | Decoding | AUC 1v2 | K* |\n47\t> |----------|---------|-----|\n48\t> | greedy | 0.6893 | 2 |\n49\t> | nucleus p=0.9 | 0.6866 | 2 |\n50\t> | temp=0.7 | 0.6887 | 2 |\n51\t> | temp=1.2 | 0.7039 | 2 |\n52\t>\n53\t> - 全部 1v2 CI lower > 0.60, 全部 2v3 CI upper < 0.60, 全部 permutation p < 0.002\n54\t> - 4 decoding strategies 的 AUC 1v2 range [0.6866, 0.7039]，K* 完全不变\n55\t> - K*=2 在所有 10 个测试条件下保持不变（5 model-mode configurations + 4 decoding strategies + 1 cross-scale 7B）\n56\t> - ⚠️ θ-sensitivity: θ=0.60 下 4/4 K*=2；θ=0.70 下仅 Config4-T12 K*=2（1v2=0.7039 仅超 0.70 阈值 0.004），其余 3 config K*=1。论文以 θ=0.60 为主结论，θ=0.70 边界效应作 footnote\n57\t> - ⚠️ 特征排序分化: K* 跨 config 稳定，但特征重要性排序不完全一致——Greedy vs T1.2 Spearman=0.53, p=0.041（Bonferroni 校正后阈值 0.0083，不显著）。论文中措辞应为 \"suggestive\" 而非确定性结论。Config4-T12 正确 top-3 features: hapax_ratio, ttr, surp_skew（非 freq_entropy）\n58\t> - ⚠️ K*=2 边缘性双端注意: Qwen-cont 1v2 CI lower=0.6015（+0.15pp 高于 θ）+ Qwen-rw 2v3 CI upper=0.5991（-0.09pp 低于 θ），K*=2 边界在两端都极边缘。Discussion/Limitations 需同时提及\n59\t> - Paper 可写：\"K*=2 is established as a consistent discrimination boundary across all 8 tested conditions (4 model-mode configurations and 4 decoding strategies; bootstrap 95% CI for AUC₁ᵥ₂ > 0.60; AUC₂ᵥ₃ CI upper < 0.60), suggesting universality beyond the ≤1.5B scale studied.\"\n60\t> - ⚠️ 措辞策略（D017 Reviewer 评估）：分两层——\"established as consistent\" 用确定性语言（8/8 有统计检验支撑），\"suggesting universality beyond\" 对外推 hedging。不升级为 \"establishing universal\"——3 模型 ≤1.5B 会引发审稿人质疑消耗 rebuttal 预算\n61\t> - ⚠️ C1' 子组件定位：呈现为\"对同一 claim 的 4 个 evidence 维度\"而非 4 个独立 finding。§4 标题用 \"K* Characterization\"，每个子节开头显式回答一个 reviewer concern，子节间用 transitional sentences 链接\n62\t\n63\t**(b) Cross-model transfer**\n64\t> - Pythia↔OLMo 90-92% accuracy retention → K*=2 不是 model self-familiarity artifact\n65\t> - 0v1 AUC > 0.96 across all transfer pairs → binary contamination signal 完全跨模型可迁移\n66\t> - 1v2+ transfer 取决于模型族相似度 → 与 K*=2 完美一致（K* 之上分辨力本就微弱）\n67\t> - transfer retention 80-92% suggests depth signal has a large text-intrinsic component（不量化具体比例，因 transfer accuracy retention ≠ 信号分解）\n68\t> - ⚠️ 数值精度：Pythia→OLMo 91.6%, OLMo→Pythia 90.3%，范围 90-92%（非 91-92%）；Qwen-cont↔Pythia 84.7%/85.2%，范围 84-85%（非 83-85%）\n69\t\n70\t**(c) Degradation ordering consistency**\n71\t> - Spearman ρ ≥ 0.85 on single-feature AUC ranking（mode-controlled, continuation）\n72\t> - Top discriminative features shared: surp_d1_std, surp_std, surp_d2_std\n73\t> - Limitation: depth-pair level 一致性在 1v2 处较弱（τ~0.37）\n74\t> - Metric: single-feature AUC ranking（model-free, not LightGBM split count）\n75\t\n76\t**(e) Representation dependence of K* (§4.x Neural Probe / §5.x Discussion)**\n77\t> - exp-015 完整 3 模型结果（frozen self-embeddings + MLP probe, each model probing its own generations）:\n78\t>   - Qwen-cont: K*(neural)=3, 2v3 AUC=0.6159, CI [0.6099, 0.6223], CI lower > 0.60 ✅\n79\t>   - Pythia-1.4B: K*(neural)=2, 2v3 AUC=0.5963, CI [0.5892, 0.6033], CI lower < 0.60 ❌\n80\t>   - OLMo-1B: K*(neural)=2, 2v3 AUC=0.5892, CI [0.5818, 0.5965], CI lower < 0.60 ❌\n81\t> - **K*(neural) 不具备 universality**：仅 Qwen-cont 达到 K*=3，Pythia/OLMo 仍为 K*=2\n82\t> - **Self-familiarity 解释**：每个模型用自己的 frozen embeddings 探测自己生成的文本。Qwen 对 Qwen-generated 文本更敏感（self-familiarity），K*=3 是 model-specific artifact 而非 universal signal\n83\t> - **K*(theory) ≥ 3 弱化**：只能 claim \"K*(theory) ≥ 3 for Qwen representations\"，不能泛化为所有模型\n84\t> - **Interpretability–deployability tradeoff 加强**：15D features 给出 universal K*=2（3/3 模型一致），neural probe 给出 model-dependent K*∈{2,3}。Model-free 方案的 universality 优势在 cross-model 结果下更明显\n85\t> - 所有 3 模型 neural 2v3 AUC > lgbm 2v3 AUC（+3.9pp 到 +5.5pp），说明 learned representations 确实恢复了额外 depth signal，但不足以在所有模型上推过 θ=0.60\n86\t> - 论文定位：**正面发现**——cross-model validation 揭示 K*(neural) 是 representation-dependent，验证了选择 model-free 15D features 作为 headline K* characterization 的正确性\n87\t> - 预防审稿人 \"why bury the stronger result?\"：K*(neural)=3 仅对 Qwen 成立且是 self-familiarity driven，不适合作为 headline result；15D K*=2 的 universality（10/10 conditions + 3/3 models）才是可靠可部署的结论\n88\t\n89\t**(d) Generation mode analysis (§4.x Analysis subsection)**\n90\t> - Signal strength: rewrite AUC 1v2=0.6957 vs continuation 0.6114（Δ=+8.4pp）\n91\t> - Transferability: continuation 80-92% retention vs rewrite 61-63%\n92\t> - Feature subset: cont→rw 89% > rw→cont 82% → continuation features 是 rewrite 的通用子集\n93\t> - Interpretation: rewrite mode 的 instruction-following 引入 mode-specific style artifacts，放大 depth signal 但降低跨模型泛化性\n94\t> - 论文定位：Analysis subsection（\"How does generation mode affect depth estimation?\"），不是独立 claim\n95\t\n96\t### Secondary: C3 (K*-Aware Data Curation Validation)\n97\tK*=2 correctly predicts that graduated refinement beyond the binary boundary provides no additional benefit: binary K*-aware filtering (0.5941 MMLU) outperforms graduated depth weighting (best 0.5892 at α=0.9), surprisal-based selection (0.5894), and DSIR distribution matching (~0.5867, ≈ no-filter level). K* serves as an actionable curation guideline — the discrimination boundary directly determines the optimal filtering granularity.\n98\t\n99\t### Supporting Analysis: Canonical Condition Selection\n100\tGeneration mode 是 depth estimation 的显著混淆变量。Methodology 段落阐述 continuation mode 作为 canonical condition 的选择及理由（不作为独立 claim）。\n101\t\n102\t## Story Spine\n103\t\n104\t- **Problem**: Web 数据正被多代递归合成文本污染。当前检测方法将合成文本视为 binary 类别（real vs synthetic），但质量随代际深度非线性退化——首代合成文本与四代合成文本的质量差异巨大却被忽视。\n105\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: Binary detectors (DivEye, Min-K%++) 不区分代际；model collapse 文献 (Shumailov et al., Alemohammad et al. 2024, Dohmatob et al. 2024) 描述宏观现象但不提供检测工具；data selection methods (DSIR, D4, DoReMi) 做分布匹配但不估计递归深度；Drayson et al. (2025) 将 binary MGT detection 应用于 importance resampling 以防止 model collapse，是目前最接近的工作。然而这些方法均做二值判断，**不估计文本经历了多少轮递归生成，也不量化辨别能力的饱和边界。**\n106\t- **Our framing**: 将递归生成建模为 iterated lossy channel，从信息论（DPI）推导出 K* 的必然存在。K* 是首次系统测量的 operational quantity——它告诉数据策展者\"在什么深度以下，depth-aware curation 比 binary detection 更有价值\"。通过 10 条件实验矩阵（5 model-mode configurations + 4 decoding strategies + 1 cross-scale 7B）系统表征 K*，揭示其 universality：**K*=2 在所有 10 个测试条件下不变**，表明递归生成存在一个与具体模型架构和解码策略无关的 universal discrimination boundary。这一发现为数据治理提供 actionable guidance——depth-aware filtering 在 K* 以内有效，且无需针对不同模型或解码配置分别调优。\n107\t- **Headline result template**: \"Recursive generation has a universal discrimination boundary at K*=2: invariant across 4 model-mode configurations, 4 decoding strategies, and 1 cross-scale probe (10 conditions total, 1B–7B scale, base+instruct), with cross-model transfer retention of 80-92% confirming depth features are largely text-intrinsic. K*=2 correctly predicts that graduated refinement beyond the binary boundary provides no additional benefit — binary filtering at K* (0.5941 MMLU) outperforms all tested alternatives including graduated weighting, surprisal selection, and DSIR.\"\n108\t\n109\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Responses\n110\t\n111\t1. **\"Universality claim 只基于小模型，能推广到更大模型吗？\"** → exp-004 已将规模扩展至 7B（Qwen2.5-7B, continuation mode, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B），K*=2 依然成立，bootstrap 95% CI 确认。结合 4 个 ≤1.5B 架构族（GPT-2 style, Pythia, OLMo, Qwen），K*=2 在 1B–7B 范围内稳定。DPI 理论保证 K*_theory 对任意规模模型存在；进一步扩展至 13B+/70B+ 是重要 future work\n112\t2. **\"只是 feature engineering + off-the-shelf classifier，方法贡献弱\"** → 贡献在 problem formulation + empirical characterization（首次测量 K*）+ 理论框架（DPI）+ universality 发现，不是分类器本身\n113\t3. **\"Prompt-chain 不代表真实世界递归污染\"** → retrain-chain ecological validity check 作为补充；prompt-chain 是 controlled experiment 的标准方法\n114\t4. **\"K*=2 太浅，graduated filtering 收益有限\"** → K*=2 恰好预测了这一结果：binary filtering at K* boundary (0.5941 MMLU) outperforms graduated weighting (best 0.5892), surprisal selection (0.5894), and DSIR (~0.5867). 这验证了 K* 作为 actionable curation guideline 的价值——discrimination boundary 直接决定了最优 filtering 粒度。K* 的 universality 意味着实践者无需为每个模型/解码配置单独标定阈值\n115\t5. **\"同模型做生成和 surprisal 计算有 bias\"** → **exp-013 直接反驳**：Pythia↔OLMo 90-92% accuracy retention，0v1 transfer AUC > 0.96。Depth signal 主要编码在文本而非 model self-familiarity\n116\t6. **\"为什么不用 learned representations\"** → **exp-015 直接回应**：frozen LLM embeddings + MLP probe 达到 K*=3（vs 15D K*=2），揭示 representation-dependent hierarchy: K*_theory ≥ K*_neural ≥ K*_15D。Hand-crafted 15D features 的优势在于 model-free transferability（80-92% cross-model retention）、可解释性（支持 degradation ordering 分析）、实用可部署性。Neural representations 多辨别 1 个深度级别但代价是 model dependence + ~100x 计算开销。这一 tradeoff 证明 15D features 是 practical choice，同时表明 theoretical boundary 延伸至 K*=2 之上\n117\t7. **\"Graduated filtering 没和 data selection methods 比\"** → exp-006 包含 DSIR baseline + α sensitivity sweep\n118\t8. **\"Decoding strategy 只测了 4 种，coverage 不够\"** → 覆盖了实践中最常见的 decoding 配置（greedy, nucleus sampling, temperature scaling high/low）；4/4 完全一致强化 universality claim；extreme decoding（top-k=1 之外的 pathological 配置）留作 future work\n119\t9. **\"为什么不直接用 LLM 做 depth estimation\"** → **exp-011 直接反驳**：GPT-5.5 和 Claude Opus 4.6 在 500 样本 zero-shot 5-class depth 分类上仅 33.1-33.2% accuracy（MAE ~1.1），低于 OBD 15-feature LightGBM 的 38.6%。二者 binary detection 均 ~88%，说明 LLM 能区分 human vs synthetic 但无法估计递归深度。depth estimation 是非平凡任务，需要专用特征工程\n120\t\n121\t## Venue Fit\n122\t\n123\t- EMNLP 2026 special theme 明确呼吁 data contamination, synthetic data feedback loops, data governance 方向的工作\n124\t- 2+1 claim 结构：C1' 是 comprehensive characterization study with universality finding，C3 是 practical application，generation mode analysis 增加深度\n125\t- Universality narrative 比 controllability 更有 impact：从 \"K* depends on X, Y, Z\" 升级为 \"K*=2 is a universal boundary\"，审稿人更容易记住和传播\n126\t- 风险：universality claim 在 ≤1.5B 规模下的外推性是最大攻击面 → 论文中 scope 明确、limitation 诚实、DPI 理论支撑泛化的合理性\n127\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eba48931-95fb-42d0-bc69-e4e39ffb368f","uuid":"b0a72694-1d77-4624-988a-698cc45660d0","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:04:40.045Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T073047/median/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — gen-depth-contamination\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR submission May 25, 2026)\n- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\n- Backup: AAAI 2027 (abstract July 25, paper August 1)\n\n## Canonical Experimental Condition\n\n**Continuation mode 是 cross-model 结论的基础。**\n\n> \"We evaluate both generation modes because real-world recursive contamination can arise from either. Our analysis reveals generation mode as a significant confound, leading us to recommend continuation mode as the canonical condition for cross-model comparisons.\"\n\n| Condition | Pythia↔OLMo | Qwen↔others | 论文定位 |\n|-----------|-------------|-------------|---------|\n| Continuation | 90-92% retention | 80-85% retention | **主实验条件** — cross-model claims 的基础 |\n| Rewrite (instruction) | N/A | 61-63% retention | **upper bound with mode-specific confound** — 仅作 ablation |\n\n**原则**：\n- C1' 的跨模型 claim 必须基于 continuation mode 数据\n- Rewrite mode 的高 AUC (0.6957 vs cont 0.6114) 是 mode-specific signal amplification，不能作为泛化性证据\n- mvp-001 (Qwen-rewrite) 定位为 \"pilot study demonstrating feasibility\"，后续用 continuation mode rigorously validate\n- cont→rw 89% vs rw→cont 82% 不对称性 → continuation features 是 rewrite 的通用子集\n\n## Core Claims (2+1 结构, D012)\n\n### Primary: C1' (K* Characterization)\n首次系统测量递归合成文本的 generational discrimination boundary K*，并揭示其 universality。\n\nDPI 理论证明有限 K*_theory 必然存在（信息论 impossibility boundary）；我们首次在受控实验中测量 K*_empirical，它提供 K*_theory 的保守下界。通过 10 条件实验矩阵（5 model-mode configurations + 4 decoding strategies + 1 cross-scale 7B）系统表征 K*_empirical 的行为，发现 K*=2 在所有 10 个测试条件下保持不变，展现出跨模型架构、跨解码策略、跨生成模式、跨模型规模（1B–7B）、跨 instruct/base 的 universality。\n\n**子组件：**\n\n**(a) K*=2 universality across architectures, generation modes, and decoding strategies**\n> **4/4 model-mode configurations 与 4/4 decoding strategies 全部 K*=2：**\n>\n> *Model × mode (exp-007):*\n> | Model | AUC 1v2 | 95% CI | CI lower > 0.60? |\n> |-------|---------|--------|-----------------|\n> | Qwen-rewrite | 0.6955 | [0.6859, 0.7041] | ✅ (+8.6pp) |\n> | Pythia-1.4B | 0.6539 | [0.6454, 0.6630] | ✅ (+4.5pp) |\n> | OLMo-1B | 0.6145 | [0.6045, 0.6247] | ✅ (+0.45pp) |\n> | Qwen-cont | 0.6112 | [0.6015, 0.6213] | ✅ (+0.15pp, 最边缘) |\n>\n> *Decoding strategy invariance (exp-003):*\n> | Decoding | AUC 1v2 | K* |\n> |----------|---------|-----|\n> | greedy | 0.6893 | 2 |\n> | nucleus p=0.9 | 0.6866 | 2 |\n> | temp=0.7 | 0.6887 | 2 |\n> | temp=1.2 | 0.7039 | 2 |\n>\n> - 全部 1v2 CI lower > 0.60, 全部 2v3 CI upper < 0.60, 全部 permutation p < 0.002\n> - 4 decoding strategies 的 AUC 1v2 range [0.6866, 0.7039]，K* 完全不变\n> - K*=2 在所有 10 个测试条件下保持不变（5 model-mode configurations + 4 decoding strategies + 1 cross-scale 7B）\n> - ⚠️ θ-sensitivity: θ=0.60 下 4/4 K*=2；θ=0.70 下仅 Config4-T12 K*=2（1v2=0.7039 仅超 0.70 阈值 0.004），其余 3 config K*=1。论文以 θ=0.60 为主结论，θ=0.70 边界效应作 footnote\n> - ⚠️ 特征排序分化: K* 跨 config 稳定，但特征重要性排序不完全一致——Greedy vs T1.2 Spearman=0.53, p=0.041（Bonferroni 校正后阈值 0.0083，不显著）。论文中措辞应为 \"suggestive\" 而非确定性结论。Config4-T12 正确 top-3 features: hapax_ratio, ttr, surp_skew（非 freq_entropy）\n> - ⚠️ K*=2 边缘性双端注意: Qwen-cont 1v2 CI lower=0.6015（+0.15pp 高于 θ）+ Qwen-rw 2v3 CI upper=0.5991（-0.09pp 低于 θ），K*=2 边界在两端都极边缘。Discussion/Limitations 需同时提及\n> - Paper 可写：\"K*=2 is established as a consistent discrimination boundary across all 8 tested conditions (4 model-mode configurations and 4 decoding strategies; bootstrap 95% CI for AUC₁ᵥ₂ > 0.60; AUC₂ᵥ₃ CI upper < 0.60), suggesting universality beyond the ≤1.5B scale studied.\"\n> - ⚠️ 措辞策略（D017 Reviewer 评估）：分两层——\"established as consistent\" 用确定性语言（8/8 有统计检验支撑），\"suggesting universality beyond\" 对外推 hedging。不升级为 \"establishing universal\"——3 模型 ≤1.5B 会引发审稿人质疑消耗 rebuttal 预算\n> - ⚠️ C1' 子组件定位：呈现为\"对同一 claim 的 4 个 evidence 维度\"而非 4 个独立 finding。§4 标题用 \"K* Characterization\"，每个子节开头显式回答一个 reviewer concern，子节间用 transitional sentences 链接\n\n**(b) Cross-model transfer**\n> - Pythia↔OLMo 90-92% accuracy retention → K*=2 不是 model self-familiarity artifact\n> - 0v1 AUC > 0.96 across all transfer pairs → binary contamination signal 完全跨模型可迁移\n> - 1v2+ transfer 取决于模型族相似度 → 与 K*=2 完美一致（K* 之上分辨力本就微弱）\n> - transfer retention 80-92% suggests depth signal has a large text-intrinsic component（不量化具体比例，因 transfer accuracy retention ≠ 信号分解）\n> - ⚠️ 数值精度：Pythia→OLMo 91.6%, OLMo→Pythia 90.3%，范围 90-92%（非 91-92%）；Qwen-cont↔Pythia 84.7%/85.2%，范围 84-85%（非 83-85%）\n\n**(c) Degradation ordering consistency**\n> - Spearman ρ ≥ 0.85 on single-feature AUC ranking（mode-controlled, continuation）\n> - Top discriminative features shared: surp_d1_std, surp_std, surp_d2_std\n> - Limitation: depth-pair level 一致性在 1v2 处较弱（τ~0.37）\n> - Metric: single-feature AUC ranking（model-free, not LightGBM split count）\n\n**(e) Representation dependence of K* (§4.x Neural Probe / §5.x Discussion)**\n> - exp-015 完整 3 模型结果（frozen self-embeddings + MLP probe, each model probing its own generations）:\n>   - Qwen-cont: K*(neural)=3, 2v3 AUC=0.6159, CI [0.6099, 0.6223], CI lower > 0.60 ✅\n>   - Pythia-1.4B: K*(neural)=2, 2v3 AUC=0.5963, CI [0.5892, 0.6033], CI lower < 0.60 ❌\n>   - OLMo-1B: K*(neural)=2, 2v3 AUC=0.5892, CI [0.5818, 0.5965], CI lower < 0.60 ❌\n> - **K*(neural) 不具备 universality**：仅 Qwen-cont 达到 K*=3，Pythia/OLMo 仍为 K*=2\n> - **Self-familiarity 解释**：每个模型用自己的 frozen embeddings 探测自己生成的文本。Qwen 对 Qwen-generated 文本更敏感（self-familiarity），K*=3 是 model-specific artifact 而非 universal signal\n> - **K*(theory) ≥ 3 弱化**：只能 claim \"K*(theory) ≥ 3 for Qwen representations\"，不能泛化为所有模型\n> - **Interpretability–deployability tradeoff 加强**：15D features 给出 universal K*=2（3/3 模型一致），neural probe 给出 model-dependent K*∈{2,3}。Model-free 方案的 universality 优势在 cross-model 结果下更明显\n> - 所有 3 模型 neural 2v3 AUC > lgbm 2v3 AUC（+3.9pp 到 +5.5pp），说明 learned representations 确实恢复了额外 depth signal，但不足以在所有模型上推过 θ=0.60\n> - 论文定位：**正面发现**——cross-model validation 揭示 K*(neural) 是 representation-dependent，验证了选择 model-free 15D features 作为 headline K* characterization 的正确性\n> - 预防审稿人 \"why bury the stronger result?\"：K*(neural)=3 仅对 Qwen 成立且是 self-familiarity driven，不适合作为 headline result；15D K*=2 的 universality（10/10 conditions + 3/3 models）才是可靠可部署的结论\n\n**(d) Generation mode analysis (§4.x Analysis subsection)**\n> - Signal strength: rewrite AUC 1v2=0.6957 vs continuation 0.6114（Δ=+8.4pp）\n> - Transferability: continuation 80-92% retention vs rewrite 61-63%\n> - Feature subset: cont→rw 89% > rw→cont 82% → continuation features 是 rewrite 的通用子集\n> - Interpretation: rewrite mode 的 instruction-following 引入 mode-specific style artifacts，放大 depth signal 但降低跨模型泛化性\n> - 论文定位：Analysis subsection（\"How does generation mode affect depth estimation?\"），不是独立 claim\n\n### Secondary: C3 (K*-Aware Data Curation Validation)\nK*=2 correctly predicts that graduated refinement beyond the binary boundary provides no additional benefit: binary K*-aware filtering (0.5941 MMLU) outperforms graduated depth weighting (best 0.5892 at α=0.9), surprisal-based selection (0.5894), and DSIR distribution matching (~0.5867, ≈ no-filter level). K* serves as an actionable curation guideline — the discrimination boundary directly determines the optimal filtering granularity.\n\n### Supporting Analysis: Canonical Condition Selection\nGeneration mode 是 depth estimation 的显著混淆变量。Methodology 段落阐述 continuation mode 作为 canonical condition 的选择及理由（不作为独立 claim）。\n\n## Story Spine\n\n- **Problem**: Web 数据正被多代递归合成文本污染。当前检测方法将合成文本视为 binary 类别（real vs synthetic），但质量随代际深度非线性退化——首代合成文本与四代合成文本的质量差异巨大却被忽视。\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: Binary detectors (DivEye, Min-K%++) 不区分代际；model collapse 文献 (Shumailov et al., Alemohammad et al. 2024, Dohmatob et al. 2024) 描述宏观现象但不提供检测工具；data selection methods (DSIR, D4, DoReMi) 做分布匹配但不估计递归深度；Drayson et al. (2025) 将 binary MGT detection 应用于 importance resampling 以防止 model collapse，是目前最接近的工作。然而这些方法均做二值判断，**不估计文本经历了多少轮递归生成，也不量化辨别能力的饱和边界。**\n- **Our framing**: 将递归生成建模为 iterated lossy channel，从信息论（DPI）推导出 K* 的必然存在。K* 是首次系统测量的 operational quantity——它告诉数据策展者\"在什么深度以下，depth-aware curation 比 binary detection 更有价值\"。通过 10 条件实验矩阵（5 model-mode configurations + 4 decoding strategies + 1 cross-scale 7B）系统表征 K*，揭示其 universality：**K*=2 在所有 10 个测试条件下不变**，表明递归生成存在一个与具体模型架构和解码策略无关的 universal discrimination boundary。这一发现为数据治理提供 actionable guidance——depth-aware filtering 在 K* 以内有效，且无需针对不同模型或解码配置分别调优。\n- **Headline result template**: \"Recursive generation has a universal discrimination boundary at K*=2: invariant across 4 model-mode configurations, 4 decoding strategies, and 1 cross-scale probe (10 conditions total, 1B–7B scale, base+instruct), with cross-model transfer retention of 80-92% confirming depth features are largely text-intrinsic. K*=2 correctly predicts that graduated refinement beyond the binary boundary provides no additional benefit — binary filtering at K* (0.5941 MMLU) outperforms all tested alternatives including graduated weighting, surprisal selection, and DSIR.\"\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Responses\n\n1. **\"Universality claim 只基于小模型，能推广到更大模型吗？\"** → exp-004 已将规模扩展至 7B（Qwen2.5-7B, continuation mode, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B），K*=2 依然成立，bootstrap 95% CI 确认。结合 4 个 ≤1.5B 架构族（GPT-2 style, Pythia, OLMo, Qwen），K*=2 在 1B–7B 范围内稳定。DPI 理论保证 K*_theory 对任意规模模型存在；进一步扩展至 13B+/70B+ 是重要 future work\n2. **\"只是 feature engineering + off-the-shelf classifier，方法贡献弱\"** → 贡献在 problem formulation + empirical characterization（首次测量 K*）+ 理论框架（DPI）+ universality 发现，不是分类器本身\n3. **\"Prompt-chain 不代表真实世界递归污染\"** → retrain-chain ecological validity check 作为补充；prompt-chain 是 controlled experiment 的标准方法\n4. **\"K*=2 太浅，graduated filtering 收益有限\"** → K*=2 恰好预测了这一结果：binary filtering at K* boundary (0.5941 MMLU) outperforms graduated weighting (best 0.5892), surprisal selection (0.5894), and DSIR (~0.5867). 这验证了 K* 作为 actionable curation guideline 的价值——discrimination boundary 直接决定了最优 filtering 粒度。K* 的 universality 意味着实践者无需为每个模型/解码配置单独标定阈值\n5. **\"同模型做生成和 surprisal 计算有 bias\"** → **exp-013 直接反驳**：Pythia↔OLMo 90-92% accuracy retention，0v1 transfer AUC > 0.96。Depth signal 主要编码在文本而非 model self-familiarity\n6. **\"为什么不用 learned representations\"** → **exp-015 直接回应**：frozen LLM embeddings + MLP probe 达到 K*=3（vs 15D K*=2），揭示 representation-dependent hierarchy: K*_theory ≥ K*_neural ≥ K*_15D。Hand-crafted 15D features 的优势在于 model-free transferability（80-92% cross-model retention）、可解释性（支持 degradation ordering 分析）、实用可部署性。Neural representations 多辨别 1 个深度级别但代价是 model dependence + ~100x 计算开销。这一 tradeoff 证明 15D features 是 practical choice，同时表明 theoretical boundary 延伸至 K*=2 之上\n7. **\"Graduated filtering 没和 data selection methods 比\"** → exp-006 包含 DSIR baseline + α sensitivity sweep\n8. **\"Decoding strategy 只测了 4 种，coverage 不够\"** → 覆盖了实践中最常见的 decoding 配置（greedy, nucleus sampling, temperature scaling high/low）；4/4 完全一致强化 universality claim；extreme decoding（top-k=1 之外的 pathological 配置）留作 future work\n9. **\"为什么不直接用 LLM 做 depth estimation\"** → **exp-011 直接反驳**：GPT-5.5 和 Claude Opus 4.6 在 500 样本 zero-shot 5-class depth 分类上仅 33.1-33.2% accuracy（MAE ~1.1），低于 OBD 15-feature LightGBM 的 38.6%。二者 binary detection 均 ~88%，说明 LLM 能区分 human vs synthetic 但无法估计递归深度。depth estimation 是非平凡任务，需要专用特征工程\n\n## Venue Fit\n\n- EMNLP 2026 special theme 明确呼吁 data contamination, synthetic data feedback loops, data governance 方向的工作\n- 2+1 claim 结构：C1' 是 comprehensive characterization study with universality finding，C3 是 practical application，generation mode analysis 增加深度\n- Universality narrative 比 controllability 更有 impact：从 \"K* depends on X, Y, Z\" 升级为 \"K*=2 is a universal boundary\"，审稿人更容易记住和传播\n- 风险：universality claim 在 ≤1.5B 规模下的外推性是最大攻击面 → 论文中 scope 明确、limitation 诚实、DPI 理论支撑泛化的合理性\n","numLines":127,"startLine":1,"totalLines":127}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014tM9a2Xnd9dmz8XbkAkWSE","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B cross-family depth chain\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。新模型族中表现较好的一个。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"k_star\": 2,\n7\t      \"pairwise_auc\": {\n8\t        \"0v1\": 0.9718,\n9\t        \"1v2\": 0.6253,\n10\t        \"2v3\": 0.5548,\n11\t        \"3v4\": 0.5212,\n12\t        \"4v5\": 0.5083\n13\t      },\n14\t      \"pairwise_auc_std\": {\n15\t        \"0v1\": 0.0028,\n16\t        \"1v2\": 0.0092,\n17\t        \"2v3\": 0.0058,\n18\t        \"3v4\": 0.0095,\n19\t        \"4v5\": 0.0071\n20\t      },\n21\t      \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n22\t        \"0v1\": {\n23\t          \"auc\": 0.9718,\n24\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.9693,\n25\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.9743,\n26\t          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n27\t        },\n28\t        \"1v2\": {\n29\t          \"auc\": 0.6253,\n30\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.6072,\n31\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.6434,\n32\t          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n33\t        },\n34\t        \"2v3\": {\n35\t          \"auc\": 0.5548,\n36\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.5447,\n37\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.5649,\n38\t          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n39\t        },\n40\t        \"3v4\": {\n41\t          \"auc\": 0.5212,\n42\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.5108,\n43\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.5316,\n44\t          \"perm_p\": 0.0012\n45\t        },\n46\t        \"4v5\": {\n47\t          \"auc\": 0.5083,\n48\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.4978,\n49\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.5188,\n50\t          \"perm_p\": 0.0892\n51\t        }\n52\t      },\n53\t      \"pairwise_jsd\": {\n54\t        \"0v1\": 0.1384,\n55\t        \"1v2\": 0.0108,\n56\t        \"2v3\": 0.0049,\n57\t        \"3v4\": 0.0038,\n58\t        \"4v5\": 0.0031\n59\t      },\n60\t      \"ordinal_mae\": 1.198,\n61\t      \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.357,\n62\t      \"top_features\": [\n63\t        \"freq_entropy\",\n64\t        \"surp_d1_mean\",\n65\t        \"surp_std\",\n66\t        \"surp_d1_skew\",\n67\t        \"hapax_ratio\"\n68\t      ]\n69\t    },\n70\t    \"tables\": [\n71\t      {\n72\t        \"title\": \"Table: LLaMA-3.1-8B pairwise depth discrimination\",\n73\t        \"columns\": [\n74\t          \"depth_pair\",\n75\t          \"auc\",\n76\t          \"ci_95\",\n77\t          \"perm_p\",\n78\t          \"k_star_boundary\"\n79\t        ],\n80\t        \"rows\": [\n81\t          [\n82\t            \"0v1\",\n83\t            0.9718,\n84\t            \"[0.9693, 0.9743]\",\n85\t            \"<0.001\",\n86\t            \"-\"\n87\t          ],\n88\t          [\n89\t            \"1v2\",\n90\t            0.6253,\n91\t            \"[0.6072, 0.6434]\",\n92\t            \"<0.001\",\n93\t            \"K*=2 ✅ (CI lower 0.607>0.60)\"\n94\t          ],\n95\t          [\n96\t            \"2v3\",\n97\t            0.5548,\n98\t            \"[0.5447, 0.5649]\",\n99\t            \"<0.001\",\n100\t            \"below θ\"\n101\t          ],\n102\t          [\n103\t            \"3v4\",\n104\t            0.5212,\n105\t            \"[0.5108, 0.5316]\",\n106\t            \"0.001\",\n107\t            \"-\"\n108\t          ],\n109\t          [\n110\t            \"4v5\",\n111\t            0.5083,\n112\t            \"[0.4978, 0.5188]\",\n113\t            \"0.089\",\n114\t            \"n.s.\"\n115\t          ]\n116\t        ]\n117\t      }\n118\t    ],\n119\t    \"figures\": [],\n120\t    \"analysis\": \"LLaMA-8B 确认 K*=2 在第二个大规模模型族（非 Qwen 系列）上成立。CI lower=0.607 高于 θ 但属 median 档预期的边缘范围（0.600-0.607）。与 Qwen-7B 的 CI lower=0.608 高度一致，说明 7-8B 规模 + cross-scorer 条件下的 1v2 边界是 systematic 而非 random。Top features 中 hapax_ratio 进入 top-5 是 LLaMA 特有——LLaMA 的 BPE 词表与 Qwen 不同，rare token 分布 在 generational degradation 下的变化模式略有差异。但 surp_d1_std/surp_std/surp_d2_std 仍在 top-10 内，与 exp-005 的 shared_top_discriminators 一致。Paper 可将 LLaMA-8B 作为 universality evidence 的第 6 个独立模型族。\\n\\n\\nLLaMA-3.1-8B 使用 GQA + RoPE 的标准 Transformer 架构，与 Qwen-7B（exp-004）同为 7-8B continuation mode + cross-scorer 条件。Qwen-7B 1v2=0.6178（CI lower 0.6079），LLaMA-8B 预期略高于 Qwen-7B（0.625 vs 0.618）因为 LLaMA 的训练数据更侧重英文 web text 与 C4 分布更匹配， 生成文本的统计特征与 Qwen scorer 的 surprisal 计算有更好的 calibration。但 CI lower 仅 0.607， 比 θ=0.60 高 0.7pp——边缘但 robust。0v1 AUC 0.972 低于 ≤1.5B 模型的 0.99+ 是因为 8B 模型 生成文本质量更高，human-gen0 到 gen1 的跨越更小。4v5 non-significant（p=0.089）与 Qwen-7B 的 4v5 p=0.0676 pattern 一致——大模型的深层代际几乎不可区分。\\n\"\n121\t  },\n122\t  {\n123\t    \"name\": \"Mistral-7B-v0.3 cross-family depth chain\",\n124\t    \"description\": \"Mistral-7B-v0.3 continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。新模型族中表现较差的一个，K* 降至 1。\\n\",\n125\t    \"results\": {\n126\t      \"k_star\": 1,\n127\t      \"pairwise_auc\": {\n128\t        \"0v1\": 0.9681,\n129\t        \"1v2\": 0.5934,\n130\t        \"2v3\": 0.5487,\n131\t        \"3v4\": 0.5195,\n132\t        \"4v5\": 0.5068\n133\t      },\n134\t      \"pairwise_auc_std\": {\n135\t        \"0v1\": 0.0031,\n136\t        \"1v2\": 0.0098,\n137\t        \"2v3\": 0.0062,\n138\t        \"3v4\": 0.0088,\n139\t        \"4v5\": 0.0075\n140\t      },\n141\t      \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n142\t        \"0v1\": {\n143\t          \"auc\": 0.9681,\n144\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.9652,\n145\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.971,\n146\t          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n147\t        },\n148\t        \"1v2\": {\n149\t          \"auc\": 0.5934,\n150\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.5821,\n151\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.6047,\n152\t          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n153\t        },\n154\t        \"2v3\": {\n155\t          \"auc\": 0.5487,\n156\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.5382,\n157\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.5592,\n158\t          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n159\t        },\n160\t        \"3v4\": {\n161\t          \"auc\": 0.5195,\n162\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.5092,\n163\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.5298,\n164\t          \"perm_p\": 0.0034\n165\t        },\n166\t        \"4v5\": {\n167\t          \"auc\": 0.5068,\n168\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.4963,\n169\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.5173,\n170\t          \"perm_p\": 0.134\n171\t        }\n172\t      },\n173\t      \"pairwise_jsd\": {\n174\t        \"0v1\": 0.1312,\n175\t        \"1v2\": 0.0079,\n176\t        \"2v3\": 0.0044,\n177\t        \"3v4\": 0.0035,\n178\t        \"4v5\": 0.0028\n179\t      },\n180\t      \"ordinal_mae\": 1.241,\n181\t      \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.342,\n182\t      \"top_features\": [\n183\t        \"surp_d1_mean\",\n184\t        \"freq_entropy\",\n185\t        \"surp_std\",\n186\t        \"surp_mean\",\n187\t        \"surp_d1_skew\"\n188\t      ]\n189\t    },\n190\t    \"tables\": [\n191\t      {\n192\t        \"title\": \"Table: Mistral-7B pairwise depth discrimination\",\n193\t        \"columns\": [\n194\t          \"depth_pair\",\n195\t          \"auc\",\n196\t          \"ci_95\",\n197\t          \"perm_p\",\n198\t          \"k_star_boundary\"\n199\t        ],\n200\t        \"rows\": [\n201\t          [\n202\t            \"0v1\",\n203\t            0.9681,\n204\t            \"[0.9652, 0.9710]\",\n205\t            \"<0.001\",\n206\t            \"-\"\n207\t          ],\n208\t          [\n209\t            \"1v2\",\n210\t            0.5934,\n211\t            \"[0.5821, 0.6047]\",\n212\t            \"<0.001\",\n213\t            \"K*=1 ❌ (CI lower 0.582<0.60)\"\n214\t          ],\n215\t          [\n216\t            \"2v3\",\n217\t            0.5487,\n218\t            \"[0.5382, 0.5592]\",\n219\t            \"<0.001\",\n220\t            \"below θ\"\n221\t          ],\n222\t          [\n223\t            \"3v4\",\n224\t            0.5195,\n225\t            \"[0.5092, 0.5298]\",\n226\t            \"0.003\",\n227\t            \"-\"\n228\t          ],\n229\t          [\n230\t            \"4v5\",\n231\t            0.5068,\n232\t            \"[0.4963, 0.5173]\",\n233\t            \"0.134\",\n234\t            \"n.s.\"\n235\t          ]\n236\t        ]\n237\t      },\n238\t      {\n239\t        \"title\": \"Table: New model family comparison\",\n240\t        \"columns\": [\n241\t          \"model\",\n242\t          \"1v2_auc\",\n243\t          \"ci_lower\",\n244\t          \"k_star\",\n245\t          \"scorer\"\n246\t        ],\n247\t        \"rows\": [\n248\t          [\n249\t            \"LLaMA-3.1-8B\",\n250\t            0.6253,\n251\t            0.6072,\n252\t            2,\n253\t            \"Qwen-1.5B\"\n254\t          ],\n255\t          [\n256\t            \"Mistral-7B-v0.3\",\n257\t            0.5934,\n258\t            0.5821,\n259\t            1,\n260\t            \"Qwen-1.5B\"\n261\t          ],\n262\t          [\n263\t            \"Qwen2.5-7B (exp-004)\",\n264\t            0.6178,\n265\t            0.6079,\n266\t            2,\n267\t            \"Qwen-1.5B\"\n268\t          ],\n269\t          [\n270\t            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B base (exp-016)\",\n271\t            0.6262,\n272\t            0.6168,\n273\t            2,\n274\t            \"self\"\n275\t          ]\n276\t        ]\n277\t      }\n278\t    ],\n279\t    \"figures\": [],\n280\t    \"analysis\": \"Mistral K*=1 是 median 档的 defining result。论文处理策略：(1) 在 §4.1 universality 结果表中 标注 Mistral 为 boundary case（CI upper 0.605 跨 θ）；(2) 在 §5.x Boundary Conditions 段落中分析三个 contributing factors（low info loss rate, cross-scorer tokenizer mismatch, feature sensitivity ceiling）；(3) 引用 DPI 理论论证 K*_theory ≥ 2 但 K*_empirical 受限于 measurement precision——类比物理实验中测量精度与真实值的关系；(4) 与 exp-015 neural probe 结果对照，论证更精细的 representation 可能恢复更高 K*。关键 rebuttal 准备：如果 reviewer 说 \\\"Mistral 证伪了 universality\\\"，回应 1v2 AUC=0.593 仍远高于 chance (0.50)，信号存在但 被 θ=0.60 阈值 cut off——这是 operational threshold choice 而非 physical boundary。\\n\\n\\nMistral-7B-v0.3 是 median 档的核心 boundary case。1v2 AUC=0.593，CI lower=0.582， CI upper=0.605——CI 上界刚好跨过 θ=0.60 但下界远低于阈值。K*=1 的根因分析：(1) Mistral 的 GQA(8 heads) + 大 vocabulary (32K) 组合意味着每个 generation step 的 information loss rate 低于 Pythia/OLMo——Mistral 是一个更\\\"高保真\\\"的 iterated channel，DPI 预测 K*_theory 更高但 K*_empirical 被 15D features 的检测灵敏度 cap 住；(2) cross-scorer 条件（Qwen-1.5B 计算 surprisal）引入 tokenizer/architecture mismatch——Mistral 使用 SentencePiece BPE 而 Qwen 使用 不同的 BPE scheme，相同文本的 token boundary 不同导致 surprisal-derived features 精度降低； (3) JSD 1v2=0.0079 是所有模型中最低的（Pythia 0.014, OLMo 0.013, Qwen-cont 0.005 但 Qwen-cont 是 self-scorer），说明 gen1→gen2 的分布变化确实很小。论文定位：Mistral 不是 counterexample 而是 principled boundary——它验证了 DPI 框架的预测，即高容量低损耗模型的 K*_empirical 受限于 feature 灵敏度而非信号不存在。exp-015 的 neural probe 结果（neural representations 比 15D 多辨别 1 个深度）暗示如果用 Mistral 自身 embeddings 做 probe 可能恢复 K*=2。\\n\"\n281\t  },\n282\t  {\n283\t    \"name\": \"Pythia-1.4B decoding strategy ablation\",\n284\t    \"description\": \"Pythia-1.4B 上复现 exp-003 的解码策略实验（greedy / nucleus p=0.9 / T=0.7 / T=1.2）， 验证解码不变性是否跨模型成立。3/4 配置确认 K*=2，T=0.7 边缘。\\n\",\n285\t    \"results\": {\n286\t      \"config1_greedy\": {\n287\t        \"k_star\": 2,\n288\t        \"pairwise_auc\": {\n289\t          \"0v1\": 0.9748,\n290\t          \"1v2\": 0.6482,\n291\t          \"2v3\": 0.5504,\n292\t          \"3v4\": 0.5163,\n293\t          \"4v5\": 0.5098\n294\t        },\n295\t        \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n296\t          \"1v2\": {\n297\t            \"auc\": 0.6482,\n298\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.6378,\n299\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.6586,\n300\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n301\t          },\n302\t          \"2v3\": {\n303\t            \"auc\": 0.5504,\n304\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.5401,\n305\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.5607,\n306\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n307\t          }\n308\t        }\n309\t      },\n310\t      \"config2_nuc09\": {\n311\t        \"k_star\": 2,\n312\t        \"pairwise_auc\": {\n313\t          \"0v1\": 0.9911,\n314\t          \"1v2\": 0.6397,\n315\t          \"2v3\": 0.5468,\n316\t          \"3v4\": 0.5138,\n317\t          \"4v5\": 0.5072\n318\t        },\n319\t        \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n320\t          \"1v2\": {\n321\t            \"auc\": 0.6397,\n322\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.6271,\n323\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.6523,\n324\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n325\t          },\n326\t          \"2v3\": {\n327\t            \"auc\": 0.5468,\n328\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.5363,\n329\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.5573,\n330\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n331\t          }\n332\t        }\n333\t      },\n334\t      \"config3_t07\": {\n335\t        \"k_star\": 1,\n336\t        \"pairwise_auc\": {\n337\t          \"0v1\": 0.9812,\n338\t          \"1v2\": 0.6118,\n339\t          \"2v3\": 0.5472,\n340\t          \"3v4\": 0.5186,\n341\t          \"4v5\": 0.5114\n342\t        },\n343\t        \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n344\t          \"1v2\": {\n345\t            \"auc\": 0.6118,\n346\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.5973,\n347\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.6263,\n348\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n349\t          },\n350\t          \"2v3\": {\n351\t            \"auc\": 0.5472,\n352\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.5368,\n353\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.5576,\n354\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n355\t          }\n356\t        }\n357\t      },\n358\t      \"config4_t12\": {\n359\t        \"k_star\": 2,\n360\t        \"pairwise_auc\": {\n361\t          \"0v1\": 0.9967,\n362\t          \"1v2\": 0.6648,\n363\t          \"2v3\": 0.5537,\n364\t          \"3v4\": 0.5171,\n365\t          \"4v5\": 0.5126\n366\t        },\n367\t        \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n368\t          \"1v2\": {\n369\t            \"auc\": 0.6648,\n370\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.6542,\n371\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.6754,\n372\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n373\t          },\n374\t          \"2v3\": {\n375\t            \"auc\": 0.5537,\n376\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.5432,\n377\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.5642,\n378\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n379\t          }\n380\t        }\n381\t      },\n382\t      \"kstar2_fraction\": 0.75,\n383\t      \"summary\": {\n384\t        \"all_0v1_above_097\": true,\n385\t        \"all_2v3_below_060\": true,\n386\t        \"t07_ci_lower\": 0.5973,\n387\t        \"t07_marginal_note\": \"CI lower 0.597 < θ=0.60 by 0.3pp\"\n388\t      }\n389\t    },\n390\t    \"tables\": [\n391\t      {\n392\t        \"title\": \"Table: Pythia decoding ablation pairwise AUC\",\n393\t        \"columns\": [\n394\t          \"config\",\n395\t          \"0v1\",\n396\t          \"1v2\",\n397\t          \"1v2 CI\",\n398\t          \"2v3\",\n399\t          \"k_star\"\n400\t        ],\n401\t        \"rows\": [\n402\t          [\n403\t            \"greedy\",\n404\t            0.9748,\n405\t            0.6482,\n406\t            \"[0.638, 0.659]\",\n407\t            0.5504,\n408\t            \"2 ✅\"\n409\t          ],\n410\t          [\n411\t            \"nuc p=0.9\",\n412\t            0.9911,\n413\t            0.6397,\n414\t            \"[0.627, 0.652]\",\n415\t            0.5468,\n416\t            \"2 ✅\"\n417\t          ],\n418\t          [\n419\t            \"T=0.7\",\n420\t            0.9812,\n421\t            0.6118,\n422\t            \"[0.597, 0.626]\",\n423\t            0.5472,\n424\t            \"1 ⚠️\"\n425\t          ],\n426\t          [\n427\t            \"T=1.2\",\n428\t            0.9967,\n429\t            0.6648,\n430\t            \"[0.654, 0.675]\",\n431\t            0.5537,\n432\t            \"2 ✅\"\n433\t          ]\n434\t        ]\n435\t      },\n436\t      {\n437\t        \"title\": \"Table: Qwen (exp-003) vs Pythia (exp-020) decoding comparison\",\n438\t        \"columns\": [\n439\t          \"config\",\n440\t          \"qwen_1v2\",\n441\t          \"pythia_1v2\",\n442\t          \"delta\",\n443\t          \"both_kstar2\"\n444\t        ],\n445\t        \"rows\": [\n446\t          [\n447\t            \"greedy\",\n448\t            0.6892,\n449\t            0.6482,\n450\t            \"-4.1pp\",\n451\t            \"✅\"\n452\t          ],\n453\t          [\n454\t            \"nuc p=0.9\",\n455\t            0.6862,\n456\t            0.6397,\n457\t            \"-4.7pp\",\n458\t            \"✅\"\n459\t          ],\n460\t          [\n461\t            \"T=0.7\",\n462\t            0.6885,\n463\t            0.6118,\n464\t            \"-7.7pp\",\n465\t            \"❌ (Pythia fails)\"\n466\t          ],\n467\t          [\n468\t            \"T=1.2\",\n469\t            0.7037,\n470\t            0.6648,\n471\t            \"-3.9pp\",\n472\t            \"✅\"\n473\t          ]\n474\t        ]\n475\t      }\n476\t    ],\n477\t    \"figures\": [],\n478\t    \"analysis\": \"3/4 K*=2 的结果使 decoding invariance claim 从 \\\"absolute\\\" 降级为 \\\"robust under standard conditions\\\"。T=0.7 的失败是 model-specific：Qwen T=0.7 的 1v2=0.689 远高于阈值（CI lower 0.680），但 Pythia T=0.7 仅 0.612（CI lower 0.597）。Qwen→Pythia 的 delta 在 T=0.7 时最大（-7.7pp vs 其他 config 的 -3.9 到 -4.7pp），说明 Pythia 对低温更敏感——可能因为 Pythia 的 vocabulary size 更小（50K vs Qwen 的 151K），低温下的 effective vocabulary 收窄更剧烈。论文处理：在 §4.x Decoding 段落中报告 7/8 跨模型×decoding configs K*=2， T=0.7 × Pythia 作为 boundary case 放入 §5.x。措辞 \\\"K*=2 is invariant to decoding strategy for T≥0.9; at T=0.7, model-dependent sensitivity emerges\\\"。\\n\\n\\nPythia-1.4B 的 baseline 1v2 AUC=0.6539（nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0），比 Qwen 的 baseline 低约 4-8pp（Qwen-rw 0.696, Qwen-cont 0.611）。在 Qwen 上 4/4 decoding configs 均 K*=2 是因为 Qwen 的 1v2 signal 有足够 headroom（最低 0.686）。Pythia 的 headroom 更小。 T=0.7 成为 edge case 的机制：低温使 Pythia 的 token selection 更集中在高概率区域，每代 生成文本的 vocabulary distribution 已经被 temperature 预先收窄（entropy reduction）， 留给 generational degradation 的可测量空间减少。具体来说，T=0.7 下 freq_entropy 和 hapax_ratio 的 baseline variance 更低，surp_std 的 depth-wise gradient 变平——这些 恰好是 1v2 discrimination 的关键 features。CI lower=0.597 仅低于 θ 0.3pp，属于 measurement noise 边界。T=1.2 给出最高 1v2（0.665）因为高温放大了 generation noise， 加速信息损失→1v2 contrast 增强。Greedy（0.648）高于 nucleus p=0.9（0.640）因为 greedy 的完全确定性使得 generational drift 在 repetition/diversity features 上 更容易被捕捉。\\n\"\n479\t  },\n480\t  {\n481\t    \"name\": \"Text length ablation (128/256/512 tokens)\",\n482\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation, 三个文本长度（128/256/512 tokens），验证 K* 的 minimum information requirement。128-token 预期 K*=1。\\n\",\n483\t    \"results\": {\n484\t      \"length_128\": {\n485\t        \"k_star\": 1,\n486\t        \"pairwise_auc\": {\n487\t          \"0v1\": 0.9893,\n488\t          \"1v2\": 0.5902,\n489\t          \"2v3\": 0.5481,\n490\t          \"3v4\": 0.5327,\n491\t          \"4v5\": 0.5189\n492\t        },\n493\t        \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n494\t          \"0v1\": {\n495\t            \"auc\": 0.9893,\n496\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.9872,\n497\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.9914,\n498\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n499\t          },\n500\t          \"1v2\": {\n501\t            \"auc\": 0.5902,\n502\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.5762,\n503\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.6042,\n504\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n505\t          },\n506\t          \"2v3\": {\n507\t            \"auc\": 0.5481,\n508\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.5342,\n509\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.562,\n510\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n511\t          },\n512\t          \"3v4\": {\n513\t            \"auc\": 0.5327,\n514\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.5188,\n515\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.5466,\n516\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0008\n517\t          },\n518\t          \"4v5\": {\n519\t            \"auc\": 0.5189,\n520\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.505,\n521\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.5328,\n522\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0243\n523\t          }\n524\t        },\n525\t        \"pairwise_jsd\": {\n526\t          \"0v1\": 0.2614,\n527\t          \"1v2\": 0.0038,\n528\t          \"2v3\": 0.0029,\n529\t          \"3v4\": 0.0024,\n530\t          \"4v5\": 0.0021\n531\t        },\n532\t        \"ordinal_mae\": 1.223,\n533\t        \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.361\n534\t      },\n535\t      \"length_256\": {\n536\t        \"k_star\": 2,\n537\t        \"pairwise_auc\": {\n538\t          \"0v1\": 0.9948,\n539\t          \"1v2\": 0.6187,\n540\t          \"2v3\": 0.5572,\n541\t          \"3v4\": 0.5378,\n542\t          \"4v5\": 0.5148\n543\t        },\n544\t        \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n545\t          \"0v1\": {\n546\t            \"auc\": 0.9948,\n547\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.9937,\n548\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.9959,\n549\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n550\t          },\n551\t          \"1v2\": {\n552\t            \"auc\": 0.6187,\n553\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.6078,\n554\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.6296,\n555\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n556\t          },\n557\t          \"2v3\": {\n558\t            \"auc\": 0.5572,\n559\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.5467,\n560\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.5677,\n561\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n562\t          },\n563\t          \"3v4\": {\n564\t            \"auc\": 0.5378,\n565\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.5273,\n566\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.5483,\n567\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n568\t          },\n569\t          \"4v5\": {\n570\t            \"auc\": 0.5148,\n571\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.5043,\n572\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.5253,\n573\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0052\n574\t          }\n575\t        },\n576\t        \"pairwise_jsd\": {\n577\t          \"0v1\": 0.2748,\n578\t          \"1v2\": 0.0046,\n579\t          \"2v3\": 0.0033,\n580\t          \"3v4\": 0.003,\n581\t          \"4v5\": 0.0027\n582\t        },\n583\t        \"ordinal_mae\": 1.172,\n584\t        \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.375\n585\t      },\n586\t      \"length_512\": {\n587\t        \"k_star\": 2,\n588\t        \"pairwise_auc\": {\n589\t          \"0v1\": 0.9971,\n590\t          \"1v2\": 0.6341,\n591\t          \"2v3\": 0.5632,\n592\t          \"3v4\": 0.5413,\n593\t          \"4v5\": 0.5156\n594\t        },\n595\t        \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n596\t          \"0v1\": {\n597\t            \"auc\": 0.9971,\n598\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.9963,\n599\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.9979,\n600\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n601\t          },\n602\t          \"1v2\": {\n603\t            \"auc\": 0.6341,\n604\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.6228,\n605\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.6454,\n606\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n607\t          },\n608\t          \"2v3\": {\n609\t            \"auc\": 0.5632,\n610\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.5529,\n611\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.5735,\n612\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n613\t          },\n614\t          \"3v4\": {\n615\t            \"auc\": 0.5413,\n616\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.531,\n617\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.5516,\n618\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n619\t          },\n620\t          \"4v5\": {\n621\t            \"auc\": 0.5156,\n622\t            \"ci_lower\": 0.5051,\n623\t            \"ci_upper\": 0.5261,\n624\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0041\n625\t          }\n626\t        },\n627\t        \"pairwise_jsd\": {\n628\t          \"0v1\": 0.2871,\n629\t          \"1v2\": 0.0052,\n630\t          \"2v3\": 0.0036,\n631\t          \"3v4\": 0.0032,\n632\t          \"4v5\": 0.0029\n633\t        },\n634\t        \"ordinal_mae\": 1.148,\n635\t        \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.384\n636\t      },\n637\t      \"length_effect_summary\": {\n638\t        \"auc_1v2_by_length\": {\n639\t          \"128\": 0.5902,\n640\t          \"256\": 0.6187,\n641\t          \"512\": 0.6341\n642\t        },\n643\t        \"kstar_by_length\": {\n644\t          \"128\": 1,\n645\t          \"256\": 2,\n646\t          \"512\": 2\n647\t        },\n648\t        \"minimum_length_for_kstar2\": 256\n649\t      }\n650\t    },\n651\t    \"tables\": [\n652\t      {\n653\t        \"title\": \"Table: Length ablation summary\",\n654\t        \"columns\": [\n655\t          \"length\",\n656\t          \"1v2_auc\",\n657\t          \"1v2 CI\",\n658\t          \"1v2_jsd\",\n659\t          \"k_star\",\n660\t          \"feature CI width (mean)\"\n661\t        ],\n662\t        \"rows\": [\n663\t          [\n664\t            128,\n665\t            0.5902,\n666\t            \"[0.576, 0.604]\",\n667\t            0.0038,\n668\t            \"1 ❌\",\n669\t            \"±0.014\"\n670\t          ],\n671\t          [\n672\t            256,\n673\t            0.6187,\n674\t            \"[0.608, 0.630]\",\n675\t            0.0046,\n676\t            \"2 ✅\",\n677\t            \"±0.011\"\n678\t          ],\n679\t          [\n680\t            512,\n681\t            0.6341,\n682\t            \"[0.623, 0.645]\",\n683\t            0.0052,\n684\t            \"2 ✅\",\n685\t            \"±0.008\"\n686\t          ]\n687\t        ]\n688\t      },\n689\t      {\n690\t        \"title\": \"Table: Per-feature AUC at 1v2 by length\",\n691\t        \"columns\": [\n692\t          \"feature\",\n693\t          \"auc_128\",\n694\t          \"auc_256\",\n695\t          \"auc_512\"\n696\t        ],\n697\t        \"rows\": [\n698\t          [\n699\t            \"freq_entropy\",\n700\t            0.554,\n701\t            0.571,\n702\t            0.582\n703\t          ],\n704\t          [\n705\t            \"surp_std\",\n706\t            0.548,\n707\t            0.565,\n708\t            0.578\n709\t          ],\n710\t          [\n711\t            \"surp_d1_std\",\n712\t            0.542,\n713\t            0.558,\n714\t            0.573\n715\t          ],\n716\t          [\n717\t            \"hapax_ratio\",\n718\t            0.536,\n719\t            0.555,\n720\t            0.569\n721\t          ],\n722\t          [\n723\t            \"ttr\",\n724\t            0.533,\n725\t            0.551,\n726\t            0.566\n727\t          ]\n728\t        ]\n729\t      }\n730\t    ],\n731\t    \"figures\": [],\n732\t    \"analysis\": \"Length ablation 的关键贡献：(1) 建立 K* 的 minimum information requirement（≥256 tokens）， 将 universality claim 的 scope 精确化；(2) 提供 DPI framework 的 quantitative validation ——如果 per-token information loss 是常数 ε，则 aggregate MI scales with n，预测 longer text → higher K*_empirical（or at least more precise measurement），实验数据完美符合； (3) 为 practitioner 提供 actionable guidance——对 128 tokens 以下的短文本不应尝试 depth estimation。128-token 的 CI upper=0.604 跨过 θ 但 lower=0.576 远低于——如果 θ 设为 0.575 则 128 tokens 也 \\\"pass\\\"，但这样会让其他多个条件变得不可靠。这进一步证明 θ=0.60 是 well-calibrated 的 operational threshold。\\n\\n\\n128-token K*=1 的根因是统计估计器的 sample size 效应，而非 depth signal 不存在。15D features 中的 distributional statistics（freq_entropy 基于 unigram 频率分布，hapax_ratio 基于 unique token 比例，surp_std/surp_skew 基于 surprisal 分布的高阶矩）在 128 tokens 下 有极高的 estimation variance。以 hapax_ratio 为例：128 tokens 中 ~80-100 unique tokens， hapax 数量的 Poisson 噪声使得 depth 0 和 depth 1 的 hapax_ratio 分布严重重叠。 surp_std 的 standard error 在 n=128 时约为 σ/√(128) ≈ σ/11.3，而 n=512 时约为 σ/22.6， precision 差 2 倍。JSD 1v2 从 512（0.0052）到 128（0.0038）的下降（-27%）直接反映了 这个 estimation noise 效应。1v2 AUC=0.5902 的 CI upper=0.6042 刚过 θ=0.60，说明 信号存在但 buried in noise。256 tokens 是 minimum viable length（CI lower=0.608 > 0.60 且 margin 合理）。512→默认长度（exp-017 使用的长度）时 AUC 进一步提升至 0.634，但 256→512 的增量（+1.5pp）远小于 128→256 的增量（+2.9pp），说明 256 已捕获主要 statistical precision gains。DPI interpretation：每个 generation step 的 mutual information loss 是 per-token 的常数 ε，但 15D features 只能在 aggregate statistics 上测量——aggregate 的 precision 需要 sufficient sample size，128 tokens 低于这个 threshold。\\n\"\n733\t  },\n734\t  {\n735\t    \"name\": \"4×4 cross-scorer matrix\",\n736\t    \"description\": \"4 generators × 4 scorers 完整交叉验证，量化 scorer independence。重现 exp_A 中的 scorer-dependence 模式但在更大矩阵上验证其可控性。\\n\",\n737\t    \"results\": {\n738\t      \"generators\": [\n739\t        \"Qwen-1.5B-cont\",\n740\t        \"Pythia-1.4B\",\n741\t        \"OLMo-1B\",\n742\t        \"Qwen2.5-7B\"\n743\t      ],\n744\t      \"scorers\": [\n745\t        \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n746\t        \"Pythia-1.4B\",\n747\t        \"OLMo-1B\",\n748\t        \"Qwen2.5-7B\"\n749\t      ],\n750\t      \"kstar_matrix\": {\n751\t        \"Qwen1.5_Qwen1.5\": 2,\n752\t        \"Qwen1.5_Pythia\": 1,\n753\t        \"Qwen1.5_OLMo\": 1,\n754\t        \"Qwen1.5_Qwen7B\": 2,\n755\t        \"Pythia_Qwen1.5\": 2,\n756\t        \"Pythia_Pythia\": 2,\n757\t        \"Pythia_OLMo\": 2,\n758\t        \"Pythia_Qwen7B\": 2,\n759\t        \"OLMo_Qwen1.5\": 2,\n760\t        \"OLMo_Pythia\": 2,\n761\t        \"OLMo_OLMo\": 2,\n762\t        \"OLMo_Qwen7B\": 2,\n763\t        \"Qwen7B_Qwen1.5\": 2,\n764\t        \"Qwen7B_Pythia\": 1,\n765\t        \"Qwen7B_OLMo\": 1,\n766\t        \"Qwen7B_Qwen7B\": 2\n767\t      },\n768\t      \"kstar2_count\": 12,\n769\t      \"kstar2_fraction\": 0.75,\n770\t      \"auc_1v2_matrix\": {\n771\t        \"Qwen1.5_Qwen1.5\": 0.6114,\n772\t        \"Qwen1.5_Pythia\": 0.5887,\n773\t        \"Qwen1.5_OLMo\": 0.5843,\n774\t        \"Qwen1.5_Qwen7B\": 0.6078,\n775\t        \"Pythia_Qwen1.5\": 0.6412,\n776\t        \"Pythia_Pythia\": 0.6539,\n777\t        \"Pythia_OLMo\": 0.6361,\n778\t        \"Pythia_Qwen7B\": 0.6387,\n779\t        \"OLMo_Qwen1.5\": 0.6058,\n780\t        \"OLMo_Pythia\": 0.6127,\n781\t        \"OLMo_OLMo\": 0.6146,\n782\t        \"OLMo_Qwen7B\": 0.6093,\n783\t        \"Qwen7B_Qwen1.5\": 0.6178,\n784\t        \"Qwen7B_Pythia\": 0.5932,\n785\t        \"Qwen7B_OLMo\": 0.5891,\n786\t        \"Qwen7B_Qwen7B\": 0.6248\n787\t      },\n788\t      \"self_scorer_avg_1v2\": 0.6262,\n789\t      \"cross_scorer_avg_1v2\": 0.6095,\n790\t      \"cross_scorer_delta\": -0.0167,\n791\t      \"feature_ranking_spearman_across_scorers\": {\n792\t        \"mean_rho\": 0.912,\n793\t        \"min_rho\": 0.873,\n794\t        \"max_rho\": 0.958\n795\t      }\n796\t    },\n797\t    \"tables\": [\n798\t      {\n799\t        \"title\": \"Table: K* cross-scorer matrix (generator × scorer)\",\n800\t        \"columns\": [\n801\t          \"generator_scorer\",\n802\t          \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n803\t          \"Pythia-1.4B\",\n804\t          \"OLMo-1B\",\n805\t          \"Qwen-7B\"\n806\t        ],\n807\t        \"rows\": [\n808\t          [\n809\t            \"Qwen-1.5B-cont\",\n810\t            \"K*=2 (0.611)\",\n811\t            \"K*=1 (0.589)\",\n812\t            \"K*=1 (0.584)\",\n813\t            \"K*=2 (0.608)\"\n814\t          ],\n815\t          [\n816\t            \"Pythia-1.4B\",\n817\t            \"K*=2 (0.641)\",\n818\t            \"K*=2 (0.654)\",\n819\t            \"K*=2 (0.636)\",\n820\t            \"K*=2 (0.639)\"\n821\t          ],\n822\t          [\n823\t            \"OLMo-1B\",\n824\t            \"K*=2 (0.606)\",\n825\t            \"K*=2 (0.613)\",\n826\t            \"K*=2 (0.615)\",\n827\t            \"K*=2 (0.609)\"\n828\t          ],\n829\t          [\n830\t            \"Qwen-7B\",\n831\t            \"K*=2 (0.618)\",\n832\t            \"K*=1 (0.593)\",\n833\t            \"K*=1 (0.589)\",\n834\t            \"K*=2 (0.625)\"\n835\t          ]\n836\t        ]\n837\t      },\n838\t      {\n839\t        \"title\": \"Table: Cross-scorer feature ranking consistency\",\n840\t        \"columns\": [\n841\t          \"scorer_pair\",\n842\t          \"spearman_rho\",\n843\t          \"p_value\"\n844\t        ],\n845\t        \"rows\": [\n846\t          [\n847\t            \"Qwen-1.5B vs Pythia\",\n848\t            0.921,\n849\t            \"<0.001\"\n850\t          ],\n851\t          [\n852\t            \"Qwen-1.5B vs OLMo\",\n853\t            0.908,\n854\t            \"<0.001\"\n855\t          ],\n856\t          [\n857\t            \"Qwen-1.5B vs Qwen-7B\",\n858\t            0.958,\n859\t            \"<0.001\"\n860\t          ],\n861\t          [\n862\t            \"Pythia vs OLMo\",\n863\t            0.947,\n864\t            \"<0.001\"\n865\t          ],\n866\t          [\n867\t            \"Pythia vs Qwen-7B\",\n868\t            0.896,\n869\t            \"<0.001\"\n870\t          ],\n871\t          [\n872\t            \"OLMo vs Qwen-7B\",\n873\t            0.873,\n874\t            \"<0.001\"\n875\t          ]\n876\t        ]\n877\t      }\n878\t    ],\n879\t    \"figures\": [],\n880\t    \"analysis\": \"12/16 K*=2 足以支撑 scorer independence claim（with scope）。论文措辞：\\\"K*=2 is scorer- independent for generators with self-scored 1v2 AUC ≥ 0.63 (Pythia, OLMo); for marginal generators (Qwen-cont, Qwen-7B with self-scored 1v2 AUC ≈ 0.61-0.62), cross-scorer noise can push measurements below θ\\\"。这与 exp_A 的 K*=1 finding（Qwen-cont cross-scored）完全一致。实际意义：实践者可以用任意 scorer 模型，只要 target generator 的 depth signal 不在阈值边缘。Feature ranking ρ≥0.87 强化了 \\\"scorer 影响的是 magnitude 而非 feature structure\\\" 的论点。与 exp-013（cross-model transfer）对照：exp-013 的 cross-model transfer retention 80-92% 测量的是 classifier 的 generalization，exp-022 测量的是 feature computation 的 scorer-dependence——两者从不同角度确认 depth signal 主要是 text-intrinsic。\\n\\n\\nCross-scorer matrix 重现 exp_A 的核心 pattern：K* 主要由 generator 决定而非 scorer， 但 generator-scorer 之间的 architectural distance 调制 signal strength。12/16 K*=2 （0.75）在 median 指标范围 [0.6, 0.85] 内。4 个 K*=1 failure 的结构化分析： (1) Qwen-1.5B-cont 作为 generator 被 Pythia/OLMo scored 时 K*=1——Qwen-cont 的 1v2 signal 本身最弱（self-scored 仅 0.611，CI lower 0.6015），cross-scorer 增加的 noise（~-2pp）足以将其推到 θ 以下；(2) Qwen-7B 被 Pythia/OLMo scored 时 K*=1—— 同理，7B 模型的 self-scored 1v2=0.618 已在边缘，加上 7B→1.4B/1B scorer 的 scale mismatch（smaller scorer 的 surprisal resolution 不足以捕捉 7B 模型的精细 depth signal）。注意 Pythia 和 OLMo 作为 generator 时完全 robust（4/4 scorers 都 K*=2）， 因为它们的 self-scored 1v2 较高（0.654 和 0.615）且与其他模型的 architectural distance 较小。Feature ranking ρ≥0.87 跨所有 scorer 组合，确认 exp_A 的 ρ≥0.90 finding 在完整矩阵上 hold（略低因为 include 了更多 distant pairs）。\\n\"\n881\t  },\n882\t  {\n883\t    \"name\": \"Retrain-chain ecological validity\",\n884\t    \"description\": \"Pythia-1.4B LoRA retrain-chain (rank=16, alpha=32), depth 0-4, 与 prompt-chain 对比验证 ecological validity。\\n\",\n885\t    \"results\": {\n886\t      \"k_star\": 2,\n887\t      \"pairwise_auc\": {\n888\t        \"0v1\": 0.9847,\n889\t        \"1v2\": 0.6312,\n890\t        \"2v3\": 0.5583,\n891\t        \"3v4\": 0.5224\n892\t      },\n893\t      \"pairwise_auc_std\": {\n894\t        \"0v1\": 0.0019,\n895\t        \"1v2\": 0.0085,\n896\t        \"2v3\": 0.0072,\n897\t        \"3v4\": 0.0098\n898\t      },\n899\t      \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n900\t        \"0v1\": {\n901\t          \"auc\": 0.9847,\n902\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.9822,\n903\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.9872,\n904\t          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n905\t        },\n906\t        \"1v2\": {\n907\t          \"auc\": 0.6312,\n908\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.6187,\n909\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.6437,\n910\t          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n911\t        },\n912\t        \"2v3\": {\n913\t          \"auc\": 0.5583,\n914\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.5472,\n915\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.5694,\n916\t          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n917\t        },\n918\t        \"3v4\": {\n919\t          \"auc\": 0.5224,\n920\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.5108,\n921\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.534,\n922\t          \"perm_p\": 0.0018\n923\t        }\n924\t      },\n925\t      \"prompt_vs_retrain_comparison\": {\n926\t        \"prompt_chain_1v2\": 0.6539,\n927\t        \"retrain_chain_1v2\": 0.6312,\n928\t        \"delta\": -0.0227,\n929\t        \"feature_spearman_rho\": 0.841,\n930\t        \"shared_top3\": true\n931\t      },\n932\t      \"ordinal_mae\": 1.152,\n933\t      \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.372\n934\t    },\n935\t    \"tables\": [\n936\t      {\n937\t        \"title\": \"Table: Prompt-chain vs retrain-chain comparison (Pythia-1.4B)\",\n938\t        \"columns\": [\n939\t          \"chain_type\",\n940\t          \"0v1\",\n941\t          \"1v2\",\n942\t          \"2v3\",\n943\t          \"3v4\",\n944\t          \"k_star\",\n945\t          \"feature_ρ\"\n946\t        ],\n947\t        \"rows\": [\n948\t          [\n949\t            \"prompt-chain\",\n950\t            0.9932,\n951\t            0.6539,\n952\t            0.5515,\n953\t            0.5153,\n954\t            2,\n955\t            \"-\"\n956\t          ],\n957\t          [\n958\t            \"retrain-chain\",\n959\t            0.9847,\n960\t            0.6312,\n961\t            0.5583,\n962\t            0.5224,\n963\t            2,\n964\t            0.841\n965\t          ]\n966\t        ]\n967\t      }\n968\t    ],\n969\t    \"figures\": [],\n970\t    \"analysis\": \"Ecological validity confirmed: K*=2 和 top features 在两种 chain type 间一致。1v2 的 -2.3pp gap 可解释为 LoRA 的 information-preserving bias（低秩约束 = 正则化 = 更慢 的 degradation）。论文定位：supporting experiment，在 §4.1 的 footnote 或 Appendix 中报告。为 reviewer concern #3（\\\"prompt-chain 不代表真实污染\\\"）提供直接回应。 注意 depth 仅到 4（非 5），因为 retrain-chain 的 GPU cost 更高（每代需要 fine-tune）。\\n\\n\\nRetrain-chain K*=2 确认了 prompt-chain 的 ecological validity，但 1v2 AUC 低 2.3pp （0.631 vs 0.654）。差异的机制：LoRA rank=16 仅修改模型参数空间的一个低秩子空间， 每代 fine-tuning 的 distribution shift 比 prompt-chain 更 gradual（prompt-chain 中 每代的 output distribution 是 model(model(...)) 的嵌套，信息损失是 multiplicative； retrain-chain 的损失是 parameter-space 的 additive drift，被 LoRA 的低秩约束抑制）。 Feature ranking Spearman ρ=0.84（vs prompt-chain），top-3 features 共享（surp_d1_std, surp_std, surp_d2_std），说明两种 chain 的 degradation mechanism 虽然不同但在 feature space 上高度一致。0v1 AUC=0.985 略低于 prompt-chain 的 0.993——retrain-chain 的 gen1 更接近 human text（因为模型是在 human text 上 fine-tune 后再 generate，而非直接 prompt model to continue）。\\n\"\n971\t  },\n972\t  {\n973\t    \"name\": \"Contamination dose-response\",\n974\t    \"description\": \"在 10%/30%/50% synthetic injection 比例下，比较 binary vs graduated filtering 的 downstream benefit scaling。\\n\",\n975\t    \"results\": {\n976\t      \"dose_10pct\": {\n977\t        \"binary_ours_mmlu\": 0.5879,\n978\t        \"graduated_a09_mmlu\": 0.5876,\n979\t        \"no_filter_mmlu\": 0.5873,\n980\t        \"binary_vs_nofilter_delta\": \"+0.06pp\",\n981\t        \"binary_vs_graduated_p\": 0.42\n982\t      },\n983\t      \"dose_30pct\": {\n984\t        \"binary_ours_mmlu\": 0.5912,\n985\t        \"graduated_a09_mmlu\": 0.5897,\n986\t        \"no_filter_mmlu\": 0.5858,\n987\t        \"binary_vs_nofilter_delta\": \"+0.54pp\",\n988\t        \"binary_vs_graduated_p\": 0.08\n989\t      },\n990\t      \"dose_50pct\": {\n991\t        \"binary_ours_mmlu\": 0.5941,\n992\t        \"graduated_a09_mmlu\": 0.5892,\n993\t        \"no_filter_mmlu\": 0.5865,\n994\t        \"binary_vs_nofilter_delta\": \"+0.76pp\",\n995\t        \"binary_vs_graduated_p\": 0.003\n996\t      },\n997\t      \"dose_response_slope\": {\n998\t        \"binary_benefit_per_10pct\": \"+0.016pp MMLU\",\n999\t        \"graduated_gap_widens\": true\n1000\t      },\n1001\t      \"key_finding\": \"binary advantage scales with contamination dose; graduated never outperforms binary at any dose level\"\n1002\t    },\n1003\t    \"tables\": [\n1004\t      {\n1005\t        \"title\": \"Table: Dose-response MMLU comparison\",\n1006\t        \"columns\": [\n1007\t          \"dose\",\n1008\t          \"binary_ours\",\n1009\t          \"graduated_a09\",\n1010\t          \"no_filter\",\n1011\t          \"binary vs no-filter Δ\",\n1012\t          \"binary vs grad p\"\n1013\t        ],\n1014\t        \"rows\": [\n1015\t          [\n1016\t            \"10%\",\n1017\t            0.5879,\n1018\t            0.5876,\n1019\t            0.5873,\n1020\t            \"+0.06pp\",\n1021\t            \"0.42 (n.s.)\"\n1022\t          ],\n1023\t          [\n1024\t            \"30%\",\n1025\t            0.5912,\n1026\t            0.5897,\n1027\t            0.5858,\n1028\t            \"+0.54pp\",\n1029\t            \"0.08 (marginal)\"\n1030\t          ],\n1031\t          [\n1032\t            \"50%\",\n1033\t            0.5941,\n1034\t            0.5892,\n1035\t            0.5865,\n1036\t            \"+0.76pp\",\n1037\t            \"0.003 **\"\n1038\t          ]\n1039\t        ]\n1040\t      }\n1041\t    ],\n1042\t    \"figures\": [],\n1043\t    \"analysis\": \"Dose-response 是 C3 claim 的重要补充。Key message: K*-aware binary filtering 的优势 不是 dose-specific artifact——它在所有测试 dose 下都是最优策略（虽然在低 dose 下差异 不显著）。Graduated filtering 的 failure 同样 dose-invariant，验证了 K*=2 作为 universal curation guideline 的 actionability。Limitation: 仅测了 3 个 dose 点， 连续 dose-response curve 留作 future work。论文定位：exp-006 (50% dose) 的 补充 ablation，放在 Appendix 或 §4.3 的 subsection。\\n\\n\\nDose-response 结果直接从 K*=2 的 information-theoretic implication 推导：因为 K*=2， depth ≥2 的文本与 depth 1 的文本在 feature space 中几乎不可区分，所以 graduated weighting （试图利用 fine-grained depth signal beyond K*）无法比 binary filtering（只区分 depth 0 vs depth ≥1）做得更好。在低 contamination dose（10%）时，filtering 的 absolute benefit 极小（~0.06pp MMLU），因为 contaminated fraction 本身很小——这使得所有策略的 difference 在统计噪声中不可分辨（p=0.42）。随着 dose 增加到 30% 和 50%，binary filtering 的优势 开始统计显著（50% dose: p=0.003），因为有更多 contaminated samples 可被正确过滤。 Graduated 在 50% dose 时的 MMLU（0.5892）与 exp-006 完全一致（实验复现）。 Binary-vs-graduated gap 从 10%（+0.03pp, n.s.）扩大到 50%（+0.49pp, p=0.003）， 说明 graduated 的 over-fitting to noise beyond K* 在高 contamination 下更有害。\\n\"\n1044\t  },\n1045\t  {\n1046\t    \"name\": \"Naturalistic Common Crawl validation\",\n1047\t    \"description\": \"对 Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot 样本做 depth prediction，与 AlignScore 和 vocabulary richness 指标做 correlation analysis。\\n\",\n1048\t    \"results\": {\n1049\t      \"n_documents\": 50000,\n1050\t      \"predicted_depth_distribution\": {\n1051\t        \"cc_2025\": {\n1052\t          \"depth_0\": 0.72,\n1053\t          \"depth_1\": 0.18,\n1054\t          \"depth_2\": 0.07,\n1055\t          \"depth_3+\": 0.03\n1056\t        },\n1057\t        \"cc_2026\": {\n1058\t          \"depth_0\": 0.65,\n1059\t          \"depth_1\": 0.22,\n1060\t          \"depth_2\": 0.09,\n1061\t          \"depth_3+\": 0.04\n1062\t        }\n1063\t      },\n1064\t      \"correlation_with_alignscore\": {\n1065\t        \"spearman_rho\": 0.418,\n1066\t        \"p_value\": \"<0.001\",\n1067\t        \"interpretation\": \"moderate positive: higher predicted depth ↔ lower text quality\"\n1068\t      },\n1069\t      \"correlation_with_vocab_richness\": {\n1070\t        \"ttr_spearman\": -0.372,\n1071\t        \"hapax_spearman\": -0.341,\n1072\t        \"freq_entropy_spearman\": -0.389\n1073\t      },\n1074\t      \"temporal_shift\": {\n1075\t        \"mean_predicted_depth_2025\": 0.42,\n1076\t        \"mean_predicted_depth_2026\": 0.51,\n1077\t        \"shift_p_value\": \"<0.001\"\n1078\t      }\n1079\t    },\n1080\t    \"tables\": [\n1081\t      {\n1082\t        \"title\": \"Table: Predicted depth distribution in Common Crawl snapshots\",\n1083\t        \"columns\": [\n1084\t          \"snapshot\",\n1085\t          \"depth 0\",\n1086\t          \"depth 1\",\n1087\t          \"depth 2\",\n1088\t          \"depth 3+\",\n1089\t          \"mean_depth\"\n1090\t        ],\n1091\t        \"rows\": [\n1092\t          [\n1093\t            \"CC 2025-Q1\",\n1094\t            \"72%\",\n1095\t            \"18%\",\n1096\t            \"7%\",\n1097\t            \"3%\",\n1098\t            0.42\n1099\t          ],\n1100\t          [\n1101\t            \"CC 2026-Q1\",\n1102\t            \"65%\",\n1103\t            \"22%\",\n1104\t            \"9%\",\n1105\t            \"4%\",\n1106\t            0.51\n1107\t          ]\n1108\t        ]\n1109\t      },\n1110\t      {\n1111\t        \"title\": \"Table: Correlation with text quality indicators\",\n1112\t        \"columns\": [\n1113\t          \"indicator\",\n1114\t          \"spearman_ρ\",\n1115\t          \"p_value\",\n1116\t          \"direction\"\n1117\t        ],\n1118\t        \"rows\": [\n1119\t          [\n1120\t            \"AlignScore\",\n1121\t            0.418,\n1122\t            \"<0.001\",\n1123\t            \"higher depth → lower quality\"\n1124\t          ],\n1125\t          [\n1126\t            \"TTR\",\n1127\t            -0.372,\n1128\t            \"<0.001\",\n1129\t            \"higher depth → lower diversity\"\n1130\t          ],\n1131\t          [\n1132\t            \"Hapax ratio\",\n1133\t            -0.341,\n1134\t            \"<0.001\",\n1135\t            \"higher depth → fewer rare words\"\n1136\t          ],\n1137\t          [\n1138\t            \"Freq entropy\",\n1139\t            -0.389,\n1140\t            \"<0.001\",\n1141\t            \"higher depth → lower entropy\"\n1142\t          ]\n1143\t        ]\n1144\t      }\n1145\t    ],\n1146\t    \"figures\": [],\n1147\t    \"analysis\": \"Naturalistic validation 提供 suggestive 而非 conclusive evidence。论文措辞谨慎： \\\"Predicted depth distributions are consistent with reported trends in synthetic content prevalence\\\" + \\\"moderate correlation with independent quality measures provides convergent validity for the OBD framework\\\"。明确 limitation：no ground truth, correlational only, confounded by non-recursive synthetic text。 论文定位：§5 Discussion 的一个 subsection 或 Appendix。\\n\\n\\nNaturalistic validation 是 median 档最不确定的实验。AlignScore correlation ρ=0.42 是 moderate 而非 strong，原因：(1) Common Crawl 包含大量非递归合成文本（SEO spam, template text, translation artifacts）会被误判为有 depth 信号；(2) AlignScore 主要衡量 factual consistency 而非 distributional degradation，两者 correlated 但不 identical；(3) 没有 ground truth depth labels，所有分析都是 correlational。Vocabulary richness 指标与 predicted depth 的负相关（ρ=-0.34 到 -0.39）符合 degradation ordering 预期：更深代次 的文本 vocabulary diversity 更低。2025→2026 的 predicted depth 增加（mean 0.42→0.51） 与公开报告的合成文本增长趋势一致，但 confounded by CC 爬取策略变化。\\n\"\n1148\t  },\n1149\t  {\n1150\t    \"name\": \"Wikipedia domain ablation\",\n1151\t    \"description\": \"Wikipedia seed data, Qwen2.5-1.5B base continuation, 验证 K*=2 是否跨数据域一致。 Status: orphaned（可能因优先级调整被搁置）。\\n\",\n1152\t    \"results\": {\n1153\t      \"k_star\": 2,\n1154\t      \"pairwise_auc\": {\n1155\t        \"0v1\": 0.9912,\n1156\t        \"1v2\": 0.6183,\n1157\t        \"2v3\": 0.5518,\n1158\t        \"3v4\": 0.5247,\n1159\t        \"4v5\": 0.5112\n1160\t      },\n1161\t      \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n1162\t        \"0v1\": {\n1163\t          \"auc\": 0.9912,\n1164\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.9895,\n1165\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.9929,\n1166\t          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n1167\t        },\n1168\t        \"1v2\": {\n1169\t          \"auc\": 0.6183,\n1170\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.6074,\n1171\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.6292,\n1172\t          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n1173\t        },\n1174\t        \"2v3\": {\n1175\t          \"auc\": 0.5518,\n1176\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.5415,\n1177\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.5621,\n1178\t          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n1179\t        },\n1180\t        \"3v4\": {\n1181\t          \"auc\": 0.5247,\n1182\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.5142,\n1183\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.5352,\n1184\t          \"perm_p\": 0.0003\n1185\t        },\n1186\t        \"4v5\": {\n1187\t          \"auc\": 0.5112,\n1188\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.5007,\n1189\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.5217,\n1190\t          \"perm_p\": 0.0312\n1191\t        }\n1192\t      },\n1193\t      \"c4_vs_wiki_comparison\": {\n1194\t        \"c4_1v2\": 0.6262,\n1195\t        \"wiki_1v2\": 0.6183,\n1196\t        \"delta\": -0.0079,\n1197\t        \"feature_ranking_rho\": 0.878\n1198\t      },\n1199\t      \"ordinal_mae\": 1.178,\n1200\t      \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.369,\n1201\t      \"top_features\": [\n1202\t        \"surp_std\",\n1203\t        \"freq_entropy\",\n1204\t        \"surp_d1_std\",\n1205\t        \"surp_d1_skew\",\n1206\t        \"surp_mean\"\n1207\t      ]\n1208\t    },\n1209\t    \"tables\": [\n1210\t      {\n1211\t        \"title\": \"Table: C4 vs Wikipedia domain comparison (Qwen-base)\",\n1212\t        \"columns\": [\n1213\t          \"domain\",\n1214\t          \"0v1\",\n1215\t          \"1v2\",\n1216\t          \"1v2 CI lower\",\n1217\t          \"2v3\",\n1218\t          \"k_star\"\n1219\t        ],\n1220\t        \"rows\": [\n1221\t          [\n1222\t            \"C4\",\n1223\t            0.987,\n1224\t            0.6262,\n1225\t            0.6168,\n1226\t            0.5496,\n1227\t            2\n1228\t          ],\n1229\t          [\n1230\t            \"Wikipedia\",\n1231\t            0.9912,\n1232\t            0.6183,\n1233\t            0.6074,\n1234\t            0.5518,\n1235\t            2\n1236\t          ]\n1237\t        ]\n1238\t      }\n1239\t    ],\n1240\t    \"figures\": [],\n1241\t    \"analysis\": \"Domain ablation 是 universality claim 的 low-hanging fruit supplement。K*=2 holds， feature ranking 高度一致（ρ=0.878），domain 对 K* 没有影响。但 orphaned status 意味着 这个实验可能不会在 EMNLP submission 前完成——如果时间不够，可以将其定位为 \\\"future work: systematic domain ablation across web, academic, and code domains\\\"。如果完成， 放入 Appendix 作为 universality 的额外 data point。\\n\\n\\nWikipedia K*=2 与 C4 一致但 1v2 AUC 低 0.8pp（0.618 vs 0.626）。差异的来源： Wikipedia 文本有更强的 structural formatting（section headers, lists, citations,  infobox-derived text），这些 domain-specific patterns 在 continuation mode 下被 model 部分保留，减少了 generation-specific degradation signal。freq_entropy 在 Wikipedia 上的 discriminative power 略低，因为 Wikipedia 的 vocabulary distribution 本身更集中 （专业术语 + 百科体裁的 formulaic expressions）。Feature ranking ρ=0.878 vs C4 说明 degradation mechanism 跨域一致但 feature importance 的具体排列有 domain-specific shift。 整体结论：K*=2 是 domain-independent，支持 universality claim 的 scope 扩展。\\n\"\n1242\t  }\n1243\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eba48931-95fb-42d0-bc69-e4e39ffb368f","uuid":"93e1cfe2-1582-4191-8f02-ce699779d032","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:04:40.146Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T073047/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B cross-family depth chain\",\n    \"description\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。新模型族中表现较好的一个。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 2,\n      \"pairwise_auc\": {\n        \"0v1\": 0.9718,\n        \"1v2\": 0.6253,\n        \"2v3\": 0.5548,\n        \"3v4\": 0.5212,\n        \"4v5\": 0.5083\n      },\n      \"pairwise_auc_std\": {\n        \"0v1\": 0.0028,\n        \"1v2\": 0.0092,\n        \"2v3\": 0.0058,\n        \"3v4\": 0.0095,\n        \"4v5\": 0.0071\n      },\n      \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n        \"0v1\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.9718,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.9693,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.9743,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n        },\n        \"1v2\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.6253,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.6072,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.6434,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n        },\n        \"2v3\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.5548,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.5447,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.5649,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n        },\n        \"3v4\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.5212,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.5108,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.5316,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0012\n        },\n        \"4v5\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.5083,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.4978,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.5188,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0892\n        }\n      },\n      \"pairwise_jsd\": {\n        \"0v1\": 0.1384,\n        \"1v2\": 0.0108,\n        \"2v3\": 0.0049,\n        \"3v4\": 0.0038,\n        \"4v5\": 0.0031\n      },\n      \"ordinal_mae\": 1.198,\n      \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.357,\n      \"top_features\": [\n        \"freq_entropy\",\n        \"surp_d1_mean\",\n        \"surp_std\",\n        \"surp_d1_skew\",\n        \"hapax_ratio\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: LLaMA-3.1-8B pairwise depth discrimination\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"depth_pair\",\n          \"auc\",\n          \"ci_95\",\n          \"perm_p\",\n          \"k_star_boundary\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"0v1\",\n            0.9718,\n            \"[0.9693, 0.9743]\",\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"-\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"1v2\",\n            0.6253,\n            \"[0.6072, 0.6434]\",\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"K*=2 ✅ (CI lower 0.607>0.60)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2v3\",\n            0.5548,\n            \"[0.5447, 0.5649]\",\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"below θ\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"3v4\",\n            0.5212,\n            \"[0.5108, 0.5316]\",\n            \"0.001\",\n            \"-\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"4v5\",\n            0.5083,\n            \"[0.4978, 0.5188]\",\n            \"0.089\",\n            \"n.s.\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"LLaMA-8B 确认 K*=2 在第二个大规模模型族（非 Qwen 系列）上成立。CI lower=0.607 高于 θ 但属 median 档预期的边缘范围（0.600-0.607）。与 Qwen-7B 的 CI lower=0.608 高度一致，说明 7-8B 规模 + cross-scorer 条件下的 1v2 边界是 systematic 而非 random。Top features 中 hapax_ratio 进入 top-5 是 LLaMA 特有——LLaMA 的 BPE 词表与 Qwen 不同，rare token 分布 在 generational degradation 下的变化模式略有差异。但 surp_d1_std/surp_std/surp_d2_std 仍在 top-10 内，与 exp-005 的 shared_top_discriminators 一致。Paper 可将 LLaMA-8B 作为 universality evidence 的第 6 个独立模型族。\\n\\n\\nLLaMA-3.1-8B 使用 GQA + RoPE 的标准 Transformer 架构，与 Qwen-7B（exp-004）同为 7-8B continuation mode + cross-scorer 条件。Qwen-7B 1v2=0.6178（CI lower 0.6079），LLaMA-8B 预期略高于 Qwen-7B（0.625 vs 0.618）因为 LLaMA 的训练数据更侧重英文 web text 与 C4 分布更匹配， 生成文本的统计特征与 Qwen scorer 的 surprisal 计算有更好的 calibration。但 CI lower 仅 0.607， 比 θ=0.60 高 0.7pp——边缘但 robust。0v1 AUC 0.972 低于 ≤1.5B 模型的 0.99+ 是因为 8B 模型 生成文本质量更高，human-gen0 到 gen1 的跨越更小。4v5 non-significant（p=0.089）与 Qwen-7B 的 4v5 p=0.0676 pattern 一致——大模型的深层代际几乎不可区分。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Mistral-7B-v0.3 cross-family depth chain\",\n    \"description\": \"Mistral-7B-v0.3 continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。新模型族中表现较差的一个，K* 降至 1。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 1,\n      \"pairwise_auc\": {\n        \"0v1\": 0.9681,\n        \"1v2\": 0.5934,\n        \"2v3\": 0.5487,\n        \"3v4\": 0.5195,\n        \"4v5\": 0.5068\n      },\n      \"pairwise_auc_std\": {\n        \"0v1\": 0.0031,\n        \"1v2\": 0.0098,\n        \"2v3\": 0.0062,\n        \"3v4\": 0.0088,\n        \"4v5\": 0.0075\n      },\n      \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n        \"0v1\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.9681,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.9652,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.971,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n        },\n        \"1v2\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.5934,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.5821,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.6047,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n        },\n        \"2v3\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.5487,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.5382,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.5592,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n        },\n        \"3v4\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.5195,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.5092,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.5298,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0034\n        },\n        \"4v5\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.5068,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.4963,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.5173,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.134\n        }\n      },\n      \"pairwise_jsd\": {\n        \"0v1\": 0.1312,\n        \"1v2\": 0.0079,\n        \"2v3\": 0.0044,\n        \"3v4\": 0.0035,\n        \"4v5\": 0.0028\n      },\n      \"ordinal_mae\": 1.241,\n      \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.342,\n      \"top_features\": [\n        \"surp_d1_mean\",\n        \"freq_entropy\",\n        \"surp_std\",\n        \"surp_mean\",\n        \"surp_d1_skew\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Mistral-7B pairwise depth discrimination\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"depth_pair\",\n          \"auc\",\n          \"ci_95\",\n          \"perm_p\",\n          \"k_star_boundary\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"0v1\",\n            0.9681,\n            \"[0.9652, 0.9710]\",\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"-\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"1v2\",\n            0.5934,\n            \"[0.5821, 0.6047]\",\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"K*=1 ❌ (CI lower 0.582<0.60)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2v3\",\n            0.5487,\n            \"[0.5382, 0.5592]\",\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"below θ\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"3v4\",\n            0.5195,\n            \"[0.5092, 0.5298]\",\n            \"0.003\",\n            \"-\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"4v5\",\n            0.5068,\n            \"[0.4963, 0.5173]\",\n            \"0.134\",\n            \"n.s.\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: New model family comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"model\",\n          \"1v2_auc\",\n          \"ci_lower\",\n          \"k_star\",\n          \"scorer\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"LLaMA-3.1-8B\",\n            0.6253,\n            0.6072,\n            2,\n            \"Qwen-1.5B\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mistral-7B-v0.3\",\n            0.5934,\n            0.5821,\n            1,\n            \"Qwen-1.5B\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-7B (exp-004)\",\n            0.6178,\n            0.6079,\n            2,\n            \"Qwen-1.5B\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B base (exp-016)\",\n            0.6262,\n            0.6168,\n            2,\n            \"self\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Mistral K*=1 是 median 档的 defining result。论文处理策略：(1) 在 §4.1 universality 结果表中 标注 Mistral 为 boundary case（CI upper 0.605 跨 θ）；(2) 在 §5.x Boundary Conditions 段落中分析三个 contributing factors（low info loss rate, cross-scorer tokenizer mismatch, feature sensitivity ceiling）；(3) 引用 DPI 理论论证 K*_theory ≥ 2 但 K*_empirical 受限于 measurement precision——类比物理实验中测量精度与真实值的关系；(4) 与 exp-015 neural probe 结果对照，论证更精细的 representation 可能恢复更高 K*。关键 rebuttal 准备：如果 reviewer 说 \\\"Mistral 证伪了 universality\\\"，回应 1v2 AUC=0.593 仍远高于 chance (0.50)，信号存在但 被 θ=0.60 阈值 cut off——这是 operational threshold choice 而非 physical boundary。\\n\\n\\nMistral-7B-v0.3 是 median 档的核心 boundary case。1v2 AUC=0.593，CI lower=0.582， CI upper=0.605——CI 上界刚好跨过 θ=0.60 但下界远低于阈值。K*=1 的根因分析：(1) Mistral 的 GQA(8 heads) + 大 vocabulary (32K) 组合意味着每个 generation step 的 information loss rate 低于 Pythia/OLMo——Mistral 是一个更\\\"高保真\\\"的 iterated channel，DPI 预测 K*_theory 更高但 K*_empirical 被 15D features 的检测灵敏度 cap 住；(2) cross-scorer 条件（Qwen-1.5B 计算 surprisal）引入 tokenizer/architecture mismatch——Mistral 使用 SentencePiece BPE 而 Qwen 使用 不同的 BPE scheme，相同文本的 token boundary 不同导致 surprisal-derived features 精度降低； (3) JSD 1v2=0.0079 是所有模型中最低的（Pythia 0.014, OLMo 0.013, Qwen-cont 0.005 但 Qwen-cont 是 self-scorer），说明 gen1→gen2 的分布变化确实很小。论文定位：Mistral 不是 counterexample 而是 principled boundary——它验证了 DPI 框架的预测，即高容量低损耗模型的 K*_empirical 受限于 feature 灵敏度而非信号不存在。exp-015 的 neural probe 结果（neural representations 比 15D 多辨别 1 个深度）暗示如果用 Mistral 自身 embeddings 做 probe 可能恢复 K*=2。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Pythia-1.4B decoding strategy ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"Pythia-1.4B 上复现 exp-003 的解码策略实验（greedy / nucleus p=0.9 / T=0.7 / T=1.2）， 验证解码不变性是否跨模型成立。3/4 配置确认 K*=2，T=0.7 边缘。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"config1_greedy\": {\n        \"k_star\": 2,\n        \"pairwise_auc\": {\n          \"0v1\": 0.9748,\n          \"1v2\": 0.6482,\n          \"2v3\": 0.5504,\n          \"3v4\": 0.5163,\n          \"4v5\": 0.5098\n        },\n        \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n          \"1v2\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.6482,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.6378,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.6586,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n          },\n          \"2v3\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5504,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.5401,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.5607,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"config2_nuc09\": {\n        \"k_star\": 2,\n        \"pairwise_auc\": {\n          \"0v1\": 0.9911,\n          \"1v2\": 0.6397,\n          \"2v3\": 0.5468,\n          \"3v4\": 0.5138,\n          \"4v5\": 0.5072\n        },\n        \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n          \"1v2\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.6397,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.6271,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.6523,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n          },\n          \"2v3\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5468,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.5363,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.5573,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"config3_t07\": {\n        \"k_star\": 1,\n        \"pairwise_auc\": {\n          \"0v1\": 0.9812,\n          \"1v2\": 0.6118,\n          \"2v3\": 0.5472,\n          \"3v4\": 0.5186,\n          \"4v5\": 0.5114\n        },\n        \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n          \"1v2\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.6118,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.5973,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.6263,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n          },\n          \"2v3\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5472,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.5368,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.5576,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"config4_t12\": {\n        \"k_star\": 2,\n        \"pairwise_auc\": {\n          \"0v1\": 0.9967,\n          \"1v2\": 0.6648,\n          \"2v3\": 0.5537,\n          \"3v4\": 0.5171,\n          \"4v5\": 0.5126\n        },\n        \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n          \"1v2\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.6648,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.6542,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.6754,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n          },\n          \"2v3\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5537,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.5432,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.5642,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"kstar2_fraction\": 0.75,\n      \"summary\": {\n        \"all_0v1_above_097\": true,\n        \"all_2v3_below_060\": true,\n        \"t07_ci_lower\": 0.5973,\n        \"t07_marginal_note\": \"CI lower 0.597 < θ=0.60 by 0.3pp\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Pythia decoding ablation pairwise AUC\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"config\",\n          \"0v1\",\n          \"1v2\",\n          \"1v2 CI\",\n          \"2v3\",\n          \"k_star\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"greedy\",\n            0.9748,\n            0.6482,\n            \"[0.638, 0.659]\",\n            0.5504,\n            \"2 ✅\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"nuc p=0.9\",\n            0.9911,\n            0.6397,\n            \"[0.627, 0.652]\",\n            0.5468,\n            \"2 ✅\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"T=0.7\",\n            0.9812,\n            0.6118,\n            \"[0.597, 0.626]\",\n            0.5472,\n            \"1 ⚠️\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"T=1.2\",\n            0.9967,\n            0.6648,\n            \"[0.654, 0.675]\",\n            0.5537,\n            \"2 ✅\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Qwen (exp-003) vs Pythia (exp-020) decoding comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"config\",\n          \"qwen_1v2\",\n          \"pythia_1v2\",\n          \"delta\",\n          \"both_kstar2\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"greedy\",\n            0.6892,\n            0.6482,\n            \"-4.1pp\",\n            \"✅\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"nuc p=0.9\",\n            0.6862,\n            0.6397,\n            \"-4.7pp\",\n            \"✅\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"T=0.7\",\n            0.6885,\n            0.6118,\n            \"-7.7pp\",\n            \"❌ (Pythia fails)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"T=1.2\",\n            0.7037,\n            0.6648,\n            \"-3.9pp\",\n            \"✅\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"3/4 K*=2 的结果使 decoding invariance claim 从 \\\"absolute\\\" 降级为 \\\"robust under standard conditions\\\"。T=0.7 的失败是 model-specific：Qwen T=0.7 的 1v2=0.689 远高于阈值（CI lower 0.680），但 Pythia T=0.7 仅 0.612（CI lower 0.597）。Qwen→Pythia 的 delta 在 T=0.7 时最大（-7.7pp vs 其他 config 的 -3.9 到 -4.7pp），说明 Pythia 对低温更敏感——可能因为 Pythia 的 vocabulary size 更小（50K vs Qwen 的 151K），低温下的 effective vocabulary 收窄更剧烈。论文处理：在 §4.x Decoding 段落中报告 7/8 跨模型×decoding configs K*=2， T=0.7 × Pythia 作为 boundary case 放入 §5.x。措辞 \\\"K*=2 is invariant to decoding strategy for T≥0.9; at T=0.7, model-dependent sensitivity emerges\\\"。\\n\\n\\nPythia-1.4B 的 baseline 1v2 AUC=0.6539（nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0），比 Qwen 的 baseline 低约 4-8pp（Qwen-rw 0.696, Qwen-cont 0.611）。在 Qwen 上 4/4 decoding configs 均 K*=2 是因为 Qwen 的 1v2 signal 有足够 headroom（最低 0.686）。Pythia 的 headroom 更小。 T=0.7 成为 edge case 的机制：低温使 Pythia 的 token selection 更集中在高概率区域，每代 生成文本的 vocabulary distribution 已经被 temperature 预先收窄（entropy reduction）， 留给 generational degradation 的可测量空间减少。具体来说，T=0.7 下 freq_entropy 和 hapax_ratio 的 baseline variance 更低，surp_std 的 depth-wise gradient 变平——这些 恰好是 1v2 discrimination 的关键 features。CI lower=0.597 仅低于 θ 0.3pp，属于 measurement noise 边界。T=1.2 给出最高 1v2（0.665）因为高温放大了 generation noise， 加速信息损失→1v2 contrast 增强。Greedy（0.648）高于 nucleus p=0.9（0.640）因为 greedy 的完全确定性使得 generational drift 在 repetition/diversity features 上 更容易被捕捉。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Text length ablation (128/256/512 tokens)\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation, 三个文本长度（128/256/512 tokens），验证 K* 的 minimum information requirement。128-token 预期 K*=1。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"length_128\": {\n        \"k_star\": 1,\n        \"pairwise_auc\": {\n          \"0v1\": 0.9893,\n          \"1v2\": 0.5902,\n          \"2v3\": 0.5481,\n          \"3v4\": 0.5327,\n          \"4v5\": 0.5189\n        },\n        \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n          \"0v1\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.9893,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.9872,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.9914,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n          },\n          \"1v2\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5902,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.5762,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.6042,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n          },\n          \"2v3\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5481,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.5342,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.562,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n          },\n          \"3v4\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5327,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.5188,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.5466,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0008\n          },\n          \"4v5\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5189,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.505,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.5328,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0243\n          }\n        },\n        \"pairwise_jsd\": {\n          \"0v1\": 0.2614,\n          \"1v2\": 0.0038,\n          \"2v3\": 0.0029,\n          \"3v4\": 0.0024,\n          \"4v5\": 0.0021\n        },\n        \"ordinal_mae\": 1.223,\n        \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.361\n      },\n      \"length_256\": {\n        \"k_star\": 2,\n        \"pairwise_auc\": {\n          \"0v1\": 0.9948,\n          \"1v2\": 0.6187,\n          \"2v3\": 0.5572,\n          \"3v4\": 0.5378,\n          \"4v5\": 0.5148\n        },\n        \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n          \"0v1\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.9948,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.9937,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.9959,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n          },\n          \"1v2\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.6187,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.6078,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.6296,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n          },\n          \"2v3\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5572,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.5467,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.5677,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n          },\n          \"3v4\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5378,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.5273,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.5483,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n          },\n          \"4v5\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5148,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.5043,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.5253,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0052\n          }\n        },\n        \"pairwise_jsd\": {\n          \"0v1\": 0.2748,\n          \"1v2\": 0.0046,\n          \"2v3\": 0.0033,\n          \"3v4\": 0.003,\n          \"4v5\": 0.0027\n        },\n        \"ordinal_mae\": 1.172,\n        \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.375\n      },\n      \"length_512\": {\n        \"k_star\": 2,\n        \"pairwise_auc\": {\n          \"0v1\": 0.9971,\n          \"1v2\": 0.6341,\n          \"2v3\": 0.5632,\n          \"3v4\": 0.5413,\n          \"4v5\": 0.5156\n        },\n        \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n          \"0v1\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.9971,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.9963,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.9979,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n          },\n          \"1v2\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.6341,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.6228,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.6454,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n          },\n          \"2v3\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5632,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.5529,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.5735,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n          },\n          \"3v4\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5413,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.531,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.5516,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n          },\n          \"4v5\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5156,\n            \"ci_lower\": 0.5051,\n            \"ci_upper\": 0.5261,\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0041\n          }\n        },\n        \"pairwise_jsd\": {\n          \"0v1\": 0.2871,\n          \"1v2\": 0.0052,\n          \"2v3\": 0.0036,\n          \"3v4\": 0.0032,\n          \"4v5\": 0.0029\n        },\n        \"ordinal_mae\": 1.148,\n        \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.384\n      },\n      \"length_effect_summary\": {\n        \"auc_1v2_by_length\": {\n          \"128\": 0.5902,\n          \"256\": 0.6187,\n          \"512\": 0.6341\n        },\n        \"kstar_by_length\": {\n          \"128\": 1,\n          \"256\": 2,\n          \"512\": 2\n        },\n        \"minimum_length_for_kstar2\": 256\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Length ablation summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"length\",\n          \"1v2_auc\",\n          \"1v2 CI\",\n          \"1v2_jsd\",\n          \"k_star\",\n          \"feature CI width (mean)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            128,\n            0.5902,\n            \"[0.576, 0.604]\",\n            0.0038,\n            \"1 ❌\",\n            \"±0.014\"\n          ],\n          [\n            256,\n            0.6187,\n            \"[0.608, 0.630]\",\n            0.0046,\n            \"2 ✅\",\n            \"±0.011\"\n          ],\n          [\n            512,\n            0.6341,\n            \"[0.623, 0.645]\",\n            0.0052,\n            \"2 ✅\",\n            \"±0.008\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Per-feature AUC at 1v2 by length\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"feature\",\n          \"auc_128\",\n          \"auc_256\",\n          \"auc_512\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"freq_entropy\",\n            0.554,\n            0.571,\n            0.582\n          ],\n          [\n            \"surp_std\",\n            0.548,\n            0.565,\n            0.578\n          ],\n          [\n            \"surp_d1_std\",\n            0.542,\n            0.558,\n            0.573\n          ],\n          [\n            \"hapax_ratio\",\n            0.536,\n            0.555,\n            0.569\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ttr\",\n            0.533,\n            0.551,\n            0.566\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Length ablation 的关键贡献：(1) 建立 K* 的 minimum information requirement（≥256 tokens）， 将 universality claim 的 scope 精确化；(2) 提供 DPI framework 的 quantitative validation ——如果 per-token information loss 是常数 ε，则 aggregate MI scales with n，预测 longer text → higher K*_empirical（or at least more precise measurement），实验数据完美符合； (3) 为 practitioner 提供 actionable guidance——对 128 tokens 以下的短文本不应尝试 depth estimation。128-token 的 CI upper=0.604 跨过 θ 但 lower=0.576 远低于——如果 θ 设为 0.575 则 128 tokens 也 \\\"pass\\\"，但这样会让其他多个条件变得不可靠。这进一步证明 θ=0.60 是 well-calibrated 的 operational threshold。\\n\\n\\n128-token K*=1 的根因是统计估计器的 sample size 效应，而非 depth signal 不存在。15D features 中的 distributional statistics（freq_entropy 基于 unigram 频率分布，hapax_ratio 基于 unique token 比例，surp_std/surp_skew 基于 surprisal 分布的高阶矩）在 128 tokens 下 有极高的 estimation variance。以 hapax_ratio 为例：128 tokens 中 ~80-100 unique tokens， hapax 数量的 Poisson 噪声使得 depth 0 和 depth 1 的 hapax_ratio 分布严重重叠。 surp_std 的 standard error 在 n=128 时约为 σ/√(128) ≈ σ/11.3，而 n=512 时约为 σ/22.6， precision 差 2 倍。JSD 1v2 从 512（0.0052）到 128（0.0038）的下降（-27%）直接反映了 这个 estimation noise 效应。1v2 AUC=0.5902 的 CI upper=0.6042 刚过 θ=0.60，说明 信号存在但 buried in noise。256 tokens 是 minimum viable length（CI lower=0.608 > 0.60 且 margin 合理）。512→默认长度（exp-017 使用的长度）时 AUC 进一步提升至 0.634，但 256→512 的增量（+1.5pp）远小于 128→256 的增量（+2.9pp），说明 256 已捕获主要 statistical precision gains。DPI interpretation：每个 generation step 的 mutual information loss 是 per-token 的常数 ε，但 15D features 只能在 aggregate statistics 上测量——aggregate 的 precision 需要 sufficient sample size，128 tokens 低于这个 threshold。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"4×4 cross-scorer matrix\",\n    \"description\": \"4 generators × 4 scorers 完整交叉验证，量化 scorer independence。重现 exp_A 中的 scorer-dependence 模式但在更大矩阵上验证其可控性。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"generators\": [\n        \"Qwen-1.5B-cont\",\n        \"Pythia-1.4B\",\n        \"OLMo-1B\",\n        \"Qwen2.5-7B\"\n      ],\n      \"scorers\": [\n        \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n        \"Pythia-1.4B\",\n        \"OLMo-1B\",\n        \"Qwen2.5-7B\"\n      ],\n      \"kstar_matrix\": {\n        \"Qwen1.5_Qwen1.5\": 2,\n        \"Qwen1.5_Pythia\": 1,\n        \"Qwen1.5_OLMo\": 1,\n        \"Qwen1.5_Qwen7B\": 2,\n        \"Pythia_Qwen1.5\": 2,\n        \"Pythia_Pythia\": 2,\n        \"Pythia_OLMo\": 2,\n        \"Pythia_Qwen7B\": 2,\n        \"OLMo_Qwen1.5\": 2,\n        \"OLMo_Pythia\": 2,\n        \"OLMo_OLMo\": 2,\n        \"OLMo_Qwen7B\": 2,\n        \"Qwen7B_Qwen1.5\": 2,\n        \"Qwen7B_Pythia\": 1,\n        \"Qwen7B_OLMo\": 1,\n        \"Qwen7B_Qwen7B\": 2\n      },\n      \"kstar2_count\": 12,\n      \"kstar2_fraction\": 0.75,\n      \"auc_1v2_matrix\": {\n        \"Qwen1.5_Qwen1.5\": 0.6114,\n        \"Qwen1.5_Pythia\": 0.5887,\n        \"Qwen1.5_OLMo\": 0.5843,\n        \"Qwen1.5_Qwen7B\": 0.6078,\n        \"Pythia_Qwen1.5\": 0.6412,\n        \"Pythia_Pythia\": 0.6539,\n        \"Pythia_OLMo\": 0.6361,\n        \"Pythia_Qwen7B\": 0.6387,\n        \"OLMo_Qwen1.5\": 0.6058,\n        \"OLMo_Pythia\": 0.6127,\n        \"OLMo_OLMo\": 0.6146,\n        \"OLMo_Qwen7B\": 0.6093,\n        \"Qwen7B_Qwen1.5\": 0.6178,\n        \"Qwen7B_Pythia\": 0.5932,\n        \"Qwen7B_OLMo\": 0.5891,\n        \"Qwen7B_Qwen7B\": 0.6248\n      },\n      \"self_scorer_avg_1v2\": 0.6262,\n      \"cross_scorer_avg_1v2\": 0.6095,\n      \"cross_scorer_delta\": -0.0167,\n      \"feature_ranking_spearman_across_scorers\": {\n        \"mean_rho\": 0.912,\n        \"min_rho\": 0.873,\n        \"max_rho\": 0.958\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: K* cross-scorer matrix (generator × scorer)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"generator_scorer\",\n          \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n          \"Pythia-1.4B\",\n          \"OLMo-1B\",\n          \"Qwen-7B\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen-1.5B-cont\",\n            \"K*=2 (0.611)\",\n            \"K*=1 (0.589)\",\n            \"K*=1 (0.584)\",\n            \"K*=2 (0.608)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Pythia-1.4B\",\n            \"K*=2 (0.641)\",\n            \"K*=2 (0.654)\",\n            \"K*=2 (0.636)\",\n            \"K*=2 (0.639)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OLMo-1B\",\n            \"K*=2 (0.606)\",\n            \"K*=2 (0.613)\",\n            \"K*=2 (0.615)\",\n            \"K*=2 (0.609)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen-7B\",\n            \"K*=2 (0.618)\",\n            \"K*=1 (0.593)\",\n            \"K*=1 (0.589)\",\n            \"K*=2 (0.625)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Cross-scorer feature ranking consistency\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"scorer_pair\",\n          \"spearman_rho\",\n          \"p_value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen-1.5B vs Pythia\",\n            0.921,\n            \"<0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen-1.5B vs OLMo\",\n            0.908,\n            \"<0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen-1.5B vs Qwen-7B\",\n            0.958,\n            \"<0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Pythia vs OLMo\",\n            0.947,\n            \"<0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Pythia vs Qwen-7B\",\n            0.896,\n            \"<0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OLMo vs Qwen-7B\",\n            0.873,\n            \"<0.001\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"12/16 K*=2 足以支撑 scorer independence claim（with scope）。论文措辞：\\\"K*=2 is scorer- independent for generators with self-scored 1v2 AUC ≥ 0.63 (Pythia, OLMo); for marginal generators (Qwen-cont, Qwen-7B with self-scored 1v2 AUC ≈ 0.61-0.62), cross-scorer noise can push measurements below θ\\\"。这与 exp_A 的 K*=1 finding（Qwen-cont cross-scored）完全一致。实际意义：实践者可以用任意 scorer 模型，只要 target generator 的 depth signal 不在阈值边缘。Feature ranking ρ≥0.87 强化了 \\\"scorer 影响的是 magnitude 而非 feature structure\\\" 的论点。与 exp-013（cross-model transfer）对照：exp-013 的 cross-model transfer retention 80-92% 测量的是 classifier 的 generalization，exp-022 测量的是 feature computation 的 scorer-dependence——两者从不同角度确认 depth signal 主要是 text-intrinsic。\\n\\n\\nCross-scorer matrix 重现 exp_A 的核心 pattern：K* 主要由 generator 决定而非 scorer， 但 generator-scorer 之间的 architectural distance 调制 signal strength。12/16 K*=2 （0.75）在 median 指标范围 [0.6, 0.85] 内。4 个 K*=1 failure 的结构化分析： (1) Qwen-1.5B-cont 作为 generator 被 Pythia/OLMo scored 时 K*=1——Qwen-cont 的 1v2 signal 本身最弱（self-scored 仅 0.611，CI lower 0.6015），cross-scorer 增加的 noise（~-2pp）足以将其推到 θ 以下；(2) Qwen-7B 被 Pythia/OLMo scored 时 K*=1—— 同理，7B 模型的 self-scored 1v2=0.618 已在边缘，加上 7B→1.4B/1B scorer 的 scale mismatch（smaller scorer 的 surprisal resolution 不足以捕捉 7B 模型的精细 depth signal）。注意 Pythia 和 OLMo 作为 generator 时完全 robust（4/4 scorers 都 K*=2）， 因为它们的 self-scored 1v2 较高（0.654 和 0.615）且与其他模型的 architectural distance 较小。Feature ranking ρ≥0.87 跨所有 scorer 组合，确认 exp_A 的 ρ≥0.90 finding 在完整矩阵上 hold（略低因为 include 了更多 distant pairs）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Retrain-chain ecological validity\",\n    \"description\": \"Pythia-1.4B LoRA retrain-chain (rank=16, alpha=32), depth 0-4, 与 prompt-chain 对比验证 ecological validity。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 2,\n      \"pairwise_auc\": {\n        \"0v1\": 0.9847,\n        \"1v2\": 0.6312,\n        \"2v3\": 0.5583,\n        \"3v4\": 0.5224\n      },\n      \"pairwise_auc_std\": {\n        \"0v1\": 0.0019,\n        \"1v2\": 0.0085,\n        \"2v3\": 0.0072,\n        \"3v4\": 0.0098\n      },\n      \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n        \"0v1\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.9847,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.9822,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.9872,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n        },\n        \"1v2\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.6312,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.6187,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.6437,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n        },\n        \"2v3\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.5583,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.5472,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.5694,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n        },\n        \"3v4\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.5224,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.5108,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.534,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0018\n        }\n      },\n      \"prompt_vs_retrain_comparison\": {\n        \"prompt_chain_1v2\": 0.6539,\n        \"retrain_chain_1v2\": 0.6312,\n        \"delta\": -0.0227,\n        \"feature_spearman_rho\": 0.841,\n        \"shared_top3\": true\n      },\n      \"ordinal_mae\": 1.152,\n      \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.372\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Prompt-chain vs retrain-chain comparison (Pythia-1.4B)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"chain_type\",\n          \"0v1\",\n          \"1v2\",\n          \"2v3\",\n          \"3v4\",\n          \"k_star\",\n          \"feature_ρ\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"prompt-chain\",\n            0.9932,\n            0.6539,\n            0.5515,\n            0.5153,\n            2,\n            \"-\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"retrain-chain\",\n            0.9847,\n            0.6312,\n            0.5583,\n            0.5224,\n            2,\n            0.841\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Ecological validity confirmed: K*=2 和 top features 在两种 chain type 间一致。1v2 的 -2.3pp gap 可解释为 LoRA 的 information-preserving bias（低秩约束 = 正则化 = 更慢 的 degradation）。论文定位：supporting experiment，在 §4.1 的 footnote 或 Appendix 中报告。为 reviewer concern #3（\\\"prompt-chain 不代表真实污染\\\"）提供直接回应。 注意 depth 仅到 4（非 5），因为 retrain-chain 的 GPU cost 更高（每代需要 fine-tune）。\\n\\n\\nRetrain-chain K*=2 确认了 prompt-chain 的 ecological validity，但 1v2 AUC 低 2.3pp （0.631 vs 0.654）。差异的机制：LoRA rank=16 仅修改模型参数空间的一个低秩子空间， 每代 fine-tuning 的 distribution shift 比 prompt-chain 更 gradual（prompt-chain 中 每代的 output distribution 是 model(model(...)) 的嵌套，信息损失是 multiplicative； retrain-chain 的损失是 parameter-space 的 additive drift，被 LoRA 的低秩约束抑制）。 Feature ranking Spearman ρ=0.84（vs prompt-chain），top-3 features 共享（surp_d1_std, surp_std, surp_d2_std），说明两种 chain 的 degradation mechanism 虽然不同但在 feature space 上高度一致。0v1 AUC=0.985 略低于 prompt-chain 的 0.993——retrain-chain 的 gen1 更接近 human text（因为模型是在 human text 上 fine-tune 后再 generate，而非直接 prompt model to continue）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Contamination dose-response\",\n    \"description\": \"在 10%/30%/50% synthetic injection 比例下，比较 binary vs graduated filtering 的 downstream benefit scaling。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"dose_10pct\": {\n        \"binary_ours_mmlu\": 0.5879,\n        \"graduated_a09_mmlu\": 0.5876,\n        \"no_filter_mmlu\": 0.5873,\n        \"binary_vs_nofilter_delta\": \"+0.06pp\",\n        \"binary_vs_graduated_p\": 0.42\n      },\n      \"dose_30pct\": {\n        \"binary_ours_mmlu\": 0.5912,\n        \"graduated_a09_mmlu\": 0.5897,\n        \"no_filter_mmlu\": 0.5858,\n        \"binary_vs_nofilter_delta\": \"+0.54pp\",\n        \"binary_vs_graduated_p\": 0.08\n      },\n      \"dose_50pct\": {\n        \"binary_ours_mmlu\": 0.5941,\n        \"graduated_a09_mmlu\": 0.5892,\n        \"no_filter_mmlu\": 0.5865,\n        \"binary_vs_nofilter_delta\": \"+0.76pp\",\n        \"binary_vs_graduated_p\": 0.003\n      },\n      \"dose_response_slope\": {\n        \"binary_benefit_per_10pct\": \"+0.016pp MMLU\",\n        \"graduated_gap_widens\": true\n      },\n      \"key_finding\": \"binary advantage scales with contamination dose; graduated never outperforms binary at any dose level\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Dose-response MMLU comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"dose\",\n          \"binary_ours\",\n          \"graduated_a09\",\n          \"no_filter\",\n          \"binary vs no-filter Δ\",\n          \"binary vs grad p\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"10%\",\n            0.5879,\n            0.5876,\n            0.5873,\n            \"+0.06pp\",\n            \"0.42 (n.s.)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"30%\",\n            0.5912,\n            0.5897,\n            0.5858,\n            \"+0.54pp\",\n            \"0.08 (marginal)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"50%\",\n            0.5941,\n            0.5892,\n            0.5865,\n            \"+0.76pp\",\n            \"0.003 **\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Dose-response 是 C3 claim 的重要补充。Key message: K*-aware binary filtering 的优势 不是 dose-specific artifact——它在所有测试 dose 下都是最优策略（虽然在低 dose 下差异 不显著）。Graduated filtering 的 failure 同样 dose-invariant，验证了 K*=2 作为 universal curation guideline 的 actionability。Limitation: 仅测了 3 个 dose 点， 连续 dose-response curve 留作 future work。论文定位：exp-006 (50% dose) 的 补充 ablation，放在 Appendix 或 §4.3 的 subsection。\\n\\n\\nDose-response 结果直接从 K*=2 的 information-theoretic implication 推导：因为 K*=2， depth ≥2 的文本与 depth 1 的文本在 feature space 中几乎不可区分，所以 graduated weighting （试图利用 fine-grained depth signal beyond K*）无法比 binary filtering（只区分 depth 0 vs depth ≥1）做得更好。在低 contamination dose（10%）时，filtering 的 absolute benefit 极小（~0.06pp MMLU），因为 contaminated fraction 本身很小——这使得所有策略的 difference 在统计噪声中不可分辨（p=0.42）。随着 dose 增加到 30% 和 50%，binary filtering 的优势 开始统计显著（50% dose: p=0.003），因为有更多 contaminated samples 可被正确过滤。 Graduated 在 50% dose 时的 MMLU（0.5892）与 exp-006 完全一致（实验复现）。 Binary-vs-graduated gap 从 10%（+0.03pp, n.s.）扩大到 50%（+0.49pp, p=0.003）， 说明 graduated 的 over-fitting to noise beyond K* 在高 contamination 下更有害。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Naturalistic Common Crawl validation\",\n    \"description\": \"对 Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot 样本做 depth prediction，与 AlignScore 和 vocabulary richness 指标做 correlation analysis。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_documents\": 50000,\n      \"predicted_depth_distribution\": {\n        \"cc_2025\": {\n          \"depth_0\": 0.72,\n          \"depth_1\": 0.18,\n          \"depth_2\": 0.07,\n          \"depth_3+\": 0.03\n        },\n        \"cc_2026\": {\n          \"depth_0\": 0.65,\n          \"depth_1\": 0.22,\n          \"depth_2\": 0.09,\n          \"depth_3+\": 0.04\n        }\n      },\n      \"correlation_with_alignscore\": {\n        \"spearman_rho\": 0.418,\n        \"p_value\": \"<0.001\",\n        \"interpretation\": \"moderate positive: higher predicted depth ↔ lower text quality\"\n      },\n      \"correlation_with_vocab_richness\": {\n        \"ttr_spearman\": -0.372,\n        \"hapax_spearman\": -0.341,\n        \"freq_entropy_spearman\": -0.389\n      },\n      \"temporal_shift\": {\n        \"mean_predicted_depth_2025\": 0.42,\n        \"mean_predicted_depth_2026\": 0.51,\n        \"shift_p_value\": \"<0.001\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Predicted depth distribution in Common Crawl snapshots\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"snapshot\",\n          \"depth 0\",\n          \"depth 1\",\n          \"depth 2\",\n          \"depth 3+\",\n          \"mean_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"CC 2025-Q1\",\n            \"72%\",\n            \"18%\",\n            \"7%\",\n            \"3%\",\n            0.42\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CC 2026-Q1\",\n            \"65%\",\n            \"22%\",\n            \"9%\",\n            \"4%\",\n            0.51\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Correlation with text quality indicators\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"indicator\",\n          \"spearman_ρ\",\n          \"p_value\",\n          \"direction\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"AlignScore\",\n            0.418,\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"higher depth → lower quality\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TTR\",\n            -0.372,\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"higher depth → lower diversity\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Hapax ratio\",\n            -0.341,\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"higher depth → fewer rare words\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Freq entropy\",\n            -0.389,\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"higher depth → lower entropy\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Naturalistic validation 提供 suggestive 而非 conclusive evidence。论文措辞谨慎： \\\"Predicted depth distributions are consistent with reported trends in synthetic content prevalence\\\" + \\\"moderate correlation with independent quality measures provides convergent validity for the OBD framework\\\"。明确 limitation：no ground truth, correlational only, confounded by non-recursive synthetic text。 论文定位：§5 Discussion 的一个 subsection 或 Appendix。\\n\\n\\nNaturalistic validation 是 median 档最不确定的实验。AlignScore correlation ρ=0.42 是 moderate 而非 strong，原因：(1) Common Crawl 包含大量非递归合成文本（SEO spam, template text, translation artifacts）会被误判为有 depth 信号；(2) AlignScore 主要衡量 factual consistency 而非 distributional degradation，两者 correlated 但不 identical；(3) 没有 ground truth depth labels，所有分析都是 correlational。Vocabulary richness 指标与 predicted depth 的负相关（ρ=-0.34 到 -0.39）符合 degradation ordering 预期：更深代次 的文本 vocabulary diversity 更低。2025→2026 的 predicted depth 增加（mean 0.42→0.51） 与公开报告的合成文本增长趋势一致，但 confounded by CC 爬取策略变化。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Wikipedia domain ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"Wikipedia seed data, Qwen2.5-1.5B base continuation, 验证 K*=2 是否跨数据域一致。 Status: orphaned（可能因优先级调整被搁置）。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 2,\n      \"pairwise_auc\": {\n        \"0v1\": 0.9912,\n        \"1v2\": 0.6183,\n        \"2v3\": 0.5518,\n        \"3v4\": 0.5247,\n        \"4v5\": 0.5112\n      },\n      \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n        \"0v1\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.9912,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.9895,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.9929,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n        },\n        \"1v2\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.6183,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.6074,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.6292,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n        },\n        \"2v3\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.5518,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.5415,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.5621,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n        },\n        \"3v4\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.5247,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.5142,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.5352,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0003\n        },\n        \"4v5\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.5112,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.5007,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.5217,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0312\n        }\n      },\n      \"c4_vs_wiki_comparison\": {\n        \"c4_1v2\": 0.6262,\n        \"wiki_1v2\": 0.6183,\n        \"delta\": -0.0079,\n        \"feature_ranking_rho\": 0.878\n      },\n      \"ordinal_mae\": 1.178,\n      \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.369,\n      \"top_features\": [\n        \"surp_std\",\n        \"freq_entropy\",\n        \"surp_d1_std\",\n        \"surp_d1_skew\",\n        \"surp_mean\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: C4 vs Wikipedia domain comparison (Qwen-base)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"domain\",\n          \"0v1\",\n          \"1v2\",\n          \"1v2 CI lower\",\n          \"2v3\",\n          \"k_star\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"C4\",\n            0.987,\n            0.6262,\n            0.6168,\n            0.5496,\n            2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Wikipedia\",\n            0.9912,\n            0.6183,\n            0.6074,\n            0.5518,\n            2\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Domain ablation 是 universality claim 的 low-hanging fruit supplement。K*=2 holds， feature ranking 高度一致（ρ=0.878），domain 对 K* 没有影响。但 orphaned status 意味着 这个实验可能不会在 EMNLP submission 前完成——如果时间不够，可以将其定位为 \\\"future work: systematic domain ablation across web, academic, and code domains\\\"。如果完成， 放入 Appendix 作为 universality 的额外 data point。\\n\\n\\nWikipedia K*=2 与 C4 一致但 1v2 AUC 低 0.8pp（0.618 vs 0.626）。差异的来源： Wikipedia 文本有更强的 structural formatting（section headers, lists, citations,  infobox-derived text），这些 domain-specific patterns 在 continuation mode 下被 model 部分保留，减少了 generation-specific degradation signal。freq_entropy 在 Wikipedia 上的 discriminative power 略低，因为 Wikipedia 的 vocabulary distribution 本身更集中 （专业术语 + 百科体裁的 formulaic expressions）。Feature ranking ρ=0.878 vs C4 说明 degradation mechanism 跨域一致但 feature importance 的具体排列有 domain-specific shift。 整体结论：K*=2 是 domain-independent，支持 universality claim 的 scope 扩展。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":1243,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1243}}}
